{"cards":{"a":{"ex":[{"en":"I saw a dog near the school.","zh":"我在學校附近看到一隻狗。"},{"en":"She bought a new notebook.","zh":"她買了一本新筆記本。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["an","the"]},"a.m.":{"ex":[{"en":"The train leaves at 7 a.m.","zh":"火車早上七點出發。"},{"en":"I usually wake up at 6 a.m.","zh":"我通常早上六點起床。"}],"hook":"a.m. 是 ante meridiem 的縮寫，指正午前。","confuse":["p.m."]},"ability":{"ex":[{"en":"Her ability to solve problems impressed us.","zh":"她解決問題的能力讓我們印象深刻。"},{"en":"Music can improve a child's ability to focus.","zh":"音樂可以提升孩子專心的能力。"}],"hook":"able（能夠）加上 -ity，變成「能力」。","confuse":["skill","talent","able"]},"able":{"ex":[{"en":"She is able to finish the project today.","zh":"她今天能完成這個專案。"},{"en":"Are you able to help me move this desk?","zh":"你能幫我搬這張桌子嗎？"}],"hook":"able 看得到「able」，想成有能力做到。","confuse":["ability","capable","available"]},"about":{"ex":[{"en":"We talked about our summer plans.","zh":"我們聊了暑假的計畫。"},{"en":"This book is about a young musician.","zh":"這本書是關於一位年輕音樂家的。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["around","above"]},"above":{"ex":[{"en":"A clock hangs above the classroom door.","zh":"教室門上方掛著一個時鐘。"},{"en":"The plane flew above the clouds.","zh":"飛機飛在雲層上方。"}],"hook":"想像箭頭往上：above 的 a 在 b 上方。","confuse":["over","below"]},"abroad":{"ex":[{"en":"My sister hopes to study abroad next year.","zh":"我姊姊希望明年出國留學。"},{"en":"He worked abroad for three years.","zh":"他在國外工作了三年。"}],"hook":"broad 是「寬廣」；想像走出國門、看見寬廣世界。","confuse":["aboard"]},"across":{"ex":[{"en":"We walked across the bridge together.","zh":"我們一起走過那座橋。"},{"en":"A small shop stands across the street.","zh":"街道對面有一家小店。"}],"hook":"across 有 cross（交叉、穿越），想像橫越馬路。","confuse":["through","cross"]},"act":{"ex":[{"en":"We must act quickly to protect the animals.","zh":"我們必須迅速採取行動來保護動物。"},{"en":"He acted bravely during the emergency.","zh":"緊急狀況時，他表現得很勇敢。"}],"hook":"act 和 action 同源；想像事情發生時立刻動起來。","confuse":["action","react"]},"action":{"ex":[{"en":"The team's quick action saved the game.","zh":"球隊迅速的行動挽救了比賽。"},{"en":"We need action, not just promises.","zh":"我們需要實際行動，而不只是承諾。"}],"hook":"act（行動）加 -ion，變成「行動」這件事。","confuse":["act","activity"]},"actor":{"ex":[{"en":"The actor practiced his lines every night.","zh":"這位男演員每晚都練習台詞。"},{"en":"My favorite actor appears in this movie.","zh":"我最喜歡的男演員有演這部電影。"}],"hook":"act（演戲）加 -or（做事的人），就是男演員。","confuse":["actress","author"]},"actress":{"ex":[{"en":"The actress won an award for her role.","zh":"這位女演員因為她的角色得獎。"},{"en":"A famous actress visited our school.","zh":"一位知名女演員造訪了我們學校。"}],"hook":"act（演戲）加 -ress，常用來指女演員。","confuse":["actor","act"]},"add":{"ex":[{"en":"Please add your name to the list.","zh":"請把你的名字加到名單上。"},{"en":"Add some milk to the coffee.","zh":"在咖啡裡加點牛奶。"}],"hook":"add 多一個 d，像再加一筆、增加一點。","confuse":["plus","addition"]},"afraid":{"ex":[{"en":"The child was afraid of the dark.","zh":"那個孩子怕黑。"},{"en":"I'm afraid to ask the teacher.","zh":"我不敢問老師。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["scared","frightened"]},"after":{"ex":[{"en":"Let's meet after class.","zh":"我們下課後見面吧。"},{"en":"She went for a walk after dinner.","zh":"她晚餐後去散步。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["before","later"]},"afternoon":{"ex":[{"en":"We have a science class this afternoon.","zh":"我們今天下午有自然課。"},{"en":"The library closes at five in the afternoon.","zh":"圖書館下午五點關門。"}],"hook":"after（之後）＋noon（正午），就是正午後的時段。","confuse":["morning","evening"]},"again":{"ex":[{"en":"Could you say that again, please?","zh":"可以請你再說一次嗎？"},{"en":"He forgot his umbrella again.","zh":"他又忘了帶雨傘。"}],"hook":"again 聽起來像「額根」；想成事情又回到原點。","confuse":["against","once"]},"age":{"ex":[{"en":"At her age, she already speaks three languages.","zh":"她這個年紀已經會說三種語言。"},{"en":"What is the age limit for this contest?","zh":"這個比賽的年齡限制是多少？"}],"hook":"age 和 old age 的 age 相同；想像年齡刻在生日蛋糕上。","confuse":["ago","aged"]},"ago":{"ex":[{"en":"We moved here two years ago.","zh":"我們兩年前搬到這裡。"},{"en":"The movie started ten minutes ago.","zh":"電影十分鐘前開始了。"}],"hook":"ago 常放在時間詞後，像把時間往過去推。","confuse":["age","before"]},"agree":{"ex":[{"en":"I agree with your idea.","zh":"我同意你的想法。"},{"en":"They agreed to meet after school.","zh":"他們同意放學後碰面。"}],"hook":"a- 加上 gree；記住 agree with someone 是「同意某人」。","confuse":["disagree","argue"]},"agreement":{"ex":[{"en":"Both teams signed the agreement.","zh":"兩支隊伍都簽了協議。"},{"en":"We reached an agreement about the schedule.","zh":"我們就行程達成了協議。"}],"hook":"agree（同意）加 -ment（結果），就是達成的協議。","confuse":["argument","arrangement"]},"air":{"ex":[{"en":"Fresh air helps me feel better.","zh":"新鮮空氣讓我感覺好一點。"},{"en":"Please let some air into the room.","zh":"請讓一些空氣進到房間裡。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["heir"]},"airplane":{"ex":[{"en":"The airplane flew over the ocean.","zh":"飛機飛越海洋。"},{"en":"We took an airplane to Japan.","zh":"我們搭飛機去日本。"}],"hook":"air（空氣）＋plane（平面）；想像飛機在空中飛行。","confuse":["airport","aircraft"]},"airport":{"ex":[{"en":"We arrived at the airport early.","zh":"我們很早就抵達機場。"},{"en":"Her father picked us up at the airport.","zh":"她爸爸到機場接我們。"}],"hook":"air（空中）＋port（港口），是飛機起降的港口。","confuse":["airplane","seaport"]},"all":{"ex":[{"en":"All the students joined the school trip.","zh":"所有學生都參加了校外教學。"},{"en":"He ate all the cookies.","zh":"他把所有餅乾都吃完了。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["every","whole"]},"allow":{"ex":[{"en":"My parents allow me to stay up late on Fridays.","zh":"我爸媽允許我星期五晚上晚點睡。"},{"en":"The teacher allowed us to use dictionaries.","zh":"老師准許我們使用字典。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["aloud","let"]},"almost":{"ex":[{"en":"It is almost midnight.","zh":"快要半夜了。"},{"en":"The soup is almost ready.","zh":"湯快煮好了。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["most","always"]},"along":{"ex":[{"en":"We walked along the river.","zh":"我們沿著河邊走。"},{"en":"A row of trees grows along this road.","zh":"這條路旁沿線種了一排樹。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["among","long"]},"already":{"ex":[{"en":"She has already eaten breakfast.","zh":"她已經吃過早餐了。"},{"en":"I already know the answer.","zh":"我已經知道答案了。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["all ready"]},"also":{"ex":[{"en":"I also want some tea.","zh":"我也想喝點茶。"},{"en":"He is also my classmate.","zh":"他也是我的同學。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["too","as well"]},"although":{"ex":[{"en":"Although it rained, we played soccer.","zh":"雖然下雨了，我們還是踢了足球。"},{"en":"Although tired, Mia kept studying.","zh":"雖然很累，Mia 還是繼續讀書。"}],"hook":"含 though（雖然），用來引出讓步","confuse":["though","but"]},"always":{"ex":[{"en":"He always arrives early.","zh":"他總是很早到。"},{"en":"I always drink water after running.","zh":"我跑完步後總是會喝水。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["usually","already"]},"am":{"ex":[{"en":"I am a high school student.","zh":"我是一名高中生。"},{"en":"I am ready now.","zh":"我現在準備好了。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["is","are"]},"an":{"ex":[{"en":"She ate an orange.","zh":"她吃了一顆柳橙。"},{"en":"He found an old coin.","zh":"他找到一枚古老的硬幣。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["a"]},"and":{"ex":[{"en":"I bought apples and bananas.","zh":"我買了蘋果和香蕉。"},{"en":"She sings and dances well.","zh":"她唱歌和跳舞都很棒。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["or"]},"angry":{"ex":[{"en":"Dad was angry about the mess.","zh":"爸爸因為這團亂而生氣。"},{"en":"She gets angry when people lie.","zh":"別人說謊時，她會生氣。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["hungry"]},"animal":{"ex":[{"en":"The panda is my favorite animal.","zh":"熊貓是我最喜歡的動物。"},{"en":"Every animal needs clean water.","zh":"每種動物都需要乾淨的水。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"another":{"ex":[{"en":"Can I have another cookie?","zh":"我可以再吃一塊餅乾嗎？"},{"en":"We need another chair.","zh":"我們還需要一張椅子。"}],"hook":"an + other，兩個字組成「另一個」","confuse":["other","the other"]},"answer":{"ex":[{"en":"I knew the answer right away.","zh":"我馬上就知道答案了。"},{"en":"Her answer made everyone laugh.","zh":"她的回答讓大家都笑了。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["question","reply"]},"ant":{"ex":[{"en":"An ant carried a crumb.","zh":"一隻螞蟻搬著一小塊麵包屑。"},{"en":"We saw an ant on the table.","zh":"我們在桌上看到一隻螞蟻。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["aunt"]},"any":{"ex":[{"en":"Any student can join the club.","zh":"任何學生都可以加入這個社團。"},{"en":"Do you have any questions?","zh":"你有任何問題嗎？"}],"hook":"","confuse":["some"]},"anybody":{"ex":[{"en":"Is anybody home?","zh":"有人在家嗎？"},{"en":"Anybody can learn to swim.","zh":"任何人都可以學游泳。"}],"hook":"any + body，指任何一個人","confuse":["anyone","somebody"]},"anyone":{"ex":[{"en":"Anyone can use this computer.","zh":"任何人都可以使用這台電腦。"},{"en":"Did anyone call me?","zh":"有人打電話找我嗎？"}],"hook":"any + one，指任何一個人","confuse":["anybody","someone"]},"anything":{"ex":[{"en":"You can ask me anything.","zh":"你什麼事都可以問我。"},{"en":"I couldn't see anything in the dark.","zh":"我在黑暗中什麼都看不見。"}],"hook":"any + thing，指任何一件事物","confuse":["something","everything"]},"apartment":{"ex":[{"en":"They rent a small apartment downtown.","zh":"他們在市中心租了一間小公寓。"},{"en":"Our apartment has two bedrooms.","zh":"我們的公寓有兩間臥室。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["department"]},"appear":{"ex":[{"en":"A rainbow appeared after the rain.","zh":"雨後出現了一道彩虹。"},{"en":"The actor will appear on TV tonight.","zh":"那位演員今晚會在電視上露面。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["disappear"]},"apple":{"ex":[{"en":"I packed an apple for lunch.","zh":"我準備了一顆蘋果當午餐。"},{"en":"This apple tastes sweet.","zh":"這顆蘋果吃起來很甜。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["apply"]},"area":{"ex":[{"en":"This area is quiet at night.","zh":"這個地區晚上很安靜。"},{"en":"Keep the play area clean.","zh":"請保持遊戲區整潔。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["era"]},"arm":{"ex":[{"en":"He broke his arm last year.","zh":"他去年摔斷了手臂。"},{"en":"Raise your arm if you know the answer.","zh":"知道答案的話請舉手。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["hand"]},"around":{"ex":[{"en":"We sat around the campfire.","zh":"我們圍坐在營火旁。"},{"en":"A fence runs around the garden.","zh":"花園四周有一道圍籬。"}],"hook":"含 round（圓），想像繞著圓周走","confuse":["round","about"]},"arrive":{"ex":[{"en":"The train will arrive at nine o'clock.","zh":"火車九點會抵達。"},{"en":"We arrived in Taipei late last night.","zh":"我們昨晚很晚才抵達台北。"}],"hook":"源自拉丁文 ad ripam「到岸邊」，船靠岸就是抵達","confuse":["arise"]},"art":{"ex":[{"en":"She loves studying art history at university.","zh":"她喜歡在大學研究藝術史。"},{"en":"This museum displays modern art from Asia.","zh":"這間博物館展出亞洲的現代藝術。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["are","ark"]},"as":{"ex":[{"en":"She smiled as she opened the gift.","zh":"她打開禮物時微笑了。"},{"en":"As the sun set, the temperature dropped quickly.","zh":"太陽下山時，氣溫迅速下降。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["at","has"]},"ask":{"ex":[{"en":"Can I ask you a question?","zh":"我可以問你一個問題嗎？"},{"en":"He asked me where the station was.","zh":"他問我車站在哪裡。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["task"]},"at":{"ex":[{"en":"I will meet you at the station.","zh":"我會在車站跟你見面。"},{"en":"The store opens at nine every morning.","zh":"這家店每天早上九點開門。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["as"]},"attack":{"ex":[{"en":"The soldiers attacked the village at dawn.","zh":"士兵在黎明時襲擊了那個村莊。"},{"en":"Scientists warned that the virus could attack the lungs.","zh":"科學家警告這種病毒可能攻擊肺部。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["attach","attend"]},"aunt":{"ex":[{"en":"My aunt is coming to visit us tomorrow.","zh":"我阿姨明天要來拜訪我們。"},{"en":"Aunt Lin gave me a red envelope at New Year.","zh":"林阿姨過年時給了我紅包。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["ant"]},"away":{"ex":[{"en":"Please move your bike away from the door.","zh":"請把你的腳踏車移離門口。"},{"en":"She ran away when the dog barked loudly.","zh":"狗大聲吠叫時，她跑走了。"}],"hook":"a- 在 + way 路：人在路上走遠，就是離開","confuse":["way","aware"]},"absence":{"ex":[{"en":"Her absence surprised the whole class.","zh":"她缺席讓全班都很意外。"},{"en":"His absence from work lasted three days.","zh":"他請假三天沒去上班。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["absent"]},"absent":{"ex":[{"en":"Mia was absent from school yesterday.","zh":"Mia 昨天沒到學校。"},{"en":"Several students were absent this morning.","zh":"今天早上有幾位學生缺席。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["absence"]},"accept":{"ex":[{"en":"She accepted the invitation.","zh":"她接受了邀請。"},{"en":"They accepted his apology.","zh":"他們接受了他的道歉。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["except"]},"accident":{"ex":[{"en":"The accident blocked traffic for an hour.","zh":"這起事故讓交通堵塞了一個小時。"},{"en":"Luckily, nobody was hurt in the accident.","zh":"幸好這場意外沒有人受傷。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["incident"]},"account":{"ex":[{"en":"I opened a savings account yesterday.","zh":"我昨天開了一個儲蓄帳戶。"},{"en":"Your account needs a stronger password.","zh":"你的帳戶需要更安全的密碼。"}],"hook":"account 含 count（計數），想到帳目","confuse":["amount"]},"active":{"ex":[{"en":"Grandpa stays active by walking every day.","zh":"爺爺每天散步，保持活躍。"},{"en":"She is active in the school club.","zh":"她積極參與學校社團。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["activity"]},"activity":{"ex":[{"en":"The school planned an outdoor activity.","zh":"學校安排了一項戶外活動。"},{"en":"This activity helps students work together.","zh":"這項活動能幫助學生合作。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["active"]},"actual":{"ex":[{"en":"The actual cost was higher than expected.","zh":"實際費用比預期的高。"},{"en":"Is that the actual reason he left?","zh":"那真的是他離開的原因嗎？"}],"hook":"","confuse":["current"]},"addition":{"ex":[{"en":"The addition of two chairs made more room.","zh":"多加兩張椅子後，空間變大了。"},{"en":"The addition of a new bus route helped residents.","zh":"新增一條公車路線對居民很有幫助。"}],"hook":"addition 裡有 add（加上）","confuse":["edition"]},"address":{"ex":[{"en":"Please write your address on this form.","zh":"請在這張表格上寫下你的地址。"},{"en":"I forgot to update my home address.","zh":"我忘了更新住址。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"admit":{"ex":[{"en":"He admitted his mistake.","zh":"他承認了自己的錯誤。"},{"en":"She admitted that she was nervous.","zh":"她承認自己很緊張。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["commit"]},"adult":{"ex":[{"en":"An adult must sign this form.","zh":"這張表格必須由成年人簽名。"},{"en":"The movie is for adults only.","zh":"這部電影只適合成年人觀看。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"advance":{"ex":[{"en":"Recent advances in medicine save lives.","zh":"醫學上的最新進展挽救了許多生命。"},{"en":"The advance of technology has changed our lives.","zh":"科技的進步改變了我們的生活。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["advantage"]},"advice":{"ex":[{"en":"My teacher gave me useful advice.","zh":"老師給了我實用的建議。"},{"en":"You should ask your doctor for advice.","zh":"你應該向醫生請教。"}],"hook":"advice 的 c 可聯想 counsel（諮詢），別和 advise 混","confuse":["advise"]},"affair":{"ex":[{"en":"The whole affair ended peacefully.","zh":"整件事最後平和地落幕。"},{"en":"That affair caused trouble for the family.","zh":"那件事給這個家庭帶來麻煩。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"affect":{"ex":[{"en":"Lack of sleep can affect your mood.","zh":"睡眠不足會影響你的心情。"},{"en":"The rain affected our travel plans.","zh":"下雨影響了我們的旅行計畫。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["effect"]},"against":{"ex":[{"en":"Most students voted against the plan.","zh":"大多數學生投票反對這項計畫。"},{"en":"She spoke against the new rule.","zh":"她發言反對這項新規定。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"ahead":{"ex":[{"en":"The bus stop is just ahead.","zh":"公車站就在前面。"},{"en":"We still have a long road ahead.","zh":"我們前方還有很長的路要走。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"aid":{"ex":[{"en":"The group sent aid to the flood victims.","zh":"這個團體把援助送給水災災民。"},{"en":"First aid can save a life.","zh":"急救可以挽救生命。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["aide"]},"aim":{"ex":[{"en":"Her aim is to become a doctor.","zh":"她的目標是成為一名醫生。"},{"en":"The main aim of this lesson is clear.","zh":"這堂課的主要目標很明確。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"aircraft":{"ex":[{"en":"The aircraft landed safely before sunset.","zh":"飛機在日落前安全降落。"},{"en":"Our aircraft carried medical supplies.","zh":"我們的航空器載運了醫療用品。"}],"hook":"air 空中＋craft 載具","confuse":["airplane","helicopter"]},"alarm":{"ex":[{"en":"The alarm woke me at six.","zh":"警報器六點把我叫醒。"},{"en":"She heard the fire alarm.","zh":"她聽見火災警報。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["alert","warn"]},"album":{"ex":[{"en":"Her new album comes out next month.","zh":"她的新專輯下個月發行。"},{"en":"I listen to this album every day.","zh":"我每天都聽這張專輯。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"alike":{"ex":[{"en":"The twins look alike.","zh":"這對雙胞胎看起來很像。"},{"en":"Their answers are surprisingly alike.","zh":"他們的答案竟然很相似。"}],"hook":"字尾 like：看起來「像」","confuse":["like","likely"]},"alive":{"ex":[{"en":"The fish is still alive.","zh":"這條魚還活著。"},{"en":"We found a plant alive under the snow.","zh":"我們發現雪底下有一株還活著的植物。"}],"hook":"a- + live：live 的狀態","confuse":["live","lively"]},"alone":{"ex":[{"en":"I prefer to study alone.","zh":"我比較喜歡獨自讀書。"},{"en":"He was alone at home.","zh":"他獨自在家。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["lonely","along"]},"aloud":{"ex":[{"en":"Please read the poem aloud.","zh":"請把這首詩唸出聲來。"},{"en":"She laughed aloud at the joke.","zh":"她聽了那個笑話，大聲笑了出來。"}],"hook":"含 loud：把聲音 loud 出來","confuse":["allowed"]},"altogether":{"ex":[{"en":"The plan was altogether wrong.","zh":"這個計畫完全錯了。"},{"en":"I am not altogether sure.","zh":"我不完全確定。"}],"hook":"all + together：全部湊齊","confuse":["all together"]},"among":{"ex":[{"en":"The teacher walked among the students.","zh":"老師走在學生之間。"},{"en":"The red flower stood out among the others.","zh":"那朵紅花在其他花之中格外顯眼。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["between"]},"amount":{"ex":[{"en":"The total amount is fifty dollars.","zh":"總金額是五十元。"},{"en":"Add a small amount of sugar.","zh":"加少量的糖。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["number","quantity"]},"ancient":{"ex":[{"en":"We visited an ancient temple.","zh":"我們參觀了一座古老的寺廟。"},{"en":"Ancient people watched the stars.","zh":"古代人觀察星星。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["antique","old"]},"anger":{"ex":[{"en":"His anger faded after a short walk.","zh":"散步一小段路後，他的怒氣消退了。"},{"en":"She spoke with anger in her voice.","zh":"她說話時語氣帶著怒氣。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["angry","danger"]},"angle":{"ex":[{"en":"Measure the angle between the two lines.","zh":"量出這兩條線之間的角度。"},{"en":"The camera captures the building from a low angle.","zh":"相機從低角度拍下那棟建築。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["angel"]},"ankle":{"ex":[{"en":"I twisted my ankle during practice.","zh":"我練習時扭到了腳踝。"},{"en":"The sock covered her ankle.","zh":"襪子蓋住了她的腳踝。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["angle"]},"anyplace":{"ex":[{"en":"You can sit anyplace you like.","zh":"你喜歡坐哪裡都可以。"},{"en":"I can't find my keys anyplace.","zh":"我到處都找不到鑰匙。"}],"hook":"any + place：any 修飾 place","confuse":["anywhere","someplace"]},"anytime":{"ex":[{"en":"Call me anytime after class.","zh":"下課後隨時可以打給我。"},{"en":"You can borrow my notes anytime.","zh":"你隨時都可以借我的筆記。"}],"hook":"any + time：任何時間","confuse":["any time"]},"anyway":{"ex":[{"en":"I was tired, but I went anyway.","zh":"我很累，但無論如何還是去了。"},{"en":"Anyway, let's start the meeting.","zh":"總之，我們開始開會吧。"}],"hook":"any + way：不管哪條路都行","confuse":["anyhow"]},"anywhere":{"ex":[{"en":"You can park anywhere along this street.","zh":"這條街上任何地方都可以停車。"},{"en":"Is there anywhere we can eat nearby?","zh":"附近有任何地方可以吃飯嗎？"}],"hook":"any + where：任何地點","confuse":["anyplace","everywhere"]},"ape":{"ex":[{"en":"An ape can use simple tools.","zh":"猿類會使用簡單的工具。"},{"en":"We saw an ape at the zoo.","zh":"我們在動物園看到一隻猿。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["monkey","gorilla"]},"appearance":{"ex":[{"en":"Her appearance changed after the haircut.","zh":"她剪完頭髮後，外表變了。"},{"en":"The house has a modern appearance.","zh":"這棟房子外觀現代。"}],"hook":"appear + -ance：appear 的名詞形式","confuse":["appear","disappearance"]},"appetite":{"ex":[{"en":"I have a big appetite after swimming.","zh":"游完泳後，我胃口很好。"},{"en":"The medicine may reduce your appetite.","zh":"這種藥可能會降低你的食慾。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["hunger"]},"apply":{"ex":[{"en":"I plan to apply for the scholarship.","zh":"我打算申請這筆獎學金。"},{"en":"You must apply online by Friday.","zh":"你必須在星期五前上網申請。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["imply","reply"]},"appreciate":{"ex":[{"en":"I appreciate your help.","zh":"我很感謝你的幫忙。"},{"en":"We really appreciate your patience.","zh":"我們真的很感謝你的耐心。"}],"hook":"preci 源自拉丁文 pretium「價值」","confuse":["appropriate","approve"]},"approach":{"ex":[{"en":"This approach works well for beginners.","zh":"這個方法很適合初學者。"},{"en":"The coach tried a different approach.","zh":"教練試了另一種方法。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["method","strategy"]},"argue":{"ex":[{"en":"They argue about money every week.","zh":"他們每週都為了錢爭吵。"},{"en":"We argued over which movie to watch.","zh":"我們為了要看哪部電影爭論起來。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["debate","discuss","quarrel"]},"argument":{"ex":[{"en":"They had an argument about who should wash the dishes.","zh":"他們為了誰該洗碗吵了一架。"},{"en":"Her argument convinced the whole class to change its mind.","zh":"她的論點說服了全班改變想法。"}],"hook":"同源 argue（爭論）＋ -ment 名詞後綴","confuse":["argue","document"]},"army":{"ex":[{"en":"My uncle served in the army for five years.","zh":"我叔叔在軍隊服役了五年。"},{"en":"The army marched into the city at dawn.","zh":"軍隊黎明時開進了城市。"}],"hook":"字根與 arm（武器、手臂）同源","confuse":["navy","arm"]},"arrange":{"ex":[{"en":"I will arrange a meeting with the new teacher.","zh":"我會安排和新老師見面。"},{"en":"Can you arrange the books in alphabetical order?","zh":"你可以把書按字母順序排好嗎？"}],"hook":"ar- 向 + range 排列成行","confuse":["arrangement","arrive"]},"arrangement":{"ex":[{"en":"We made an arrangement to share the cost of the trip.","zh":"我們達成協議，共同分攤旅費。"},{"en":"The flowers in the vase make a beautiful arrangement.","zh":"花瓶裡的花擺成很漂亮的花藝作品。"}],"hook":"arrange 安排 + -ment 名詞後綴","confuse":["arrange","argument"]},"arrival":{"ex":[{"en":"The arrival of the train was delayed by an hour.","zh":"火車的抵達延遲了一小時。"},{"en":"Please check the arrival time on the screen.","zh":"請看螢幕上的抵達時間。"}],"hook":"arrive 抵達 + -al 名詞後綴","confuse":["arrive","approval"]},"arrow":{"ex":[{"en":"The archer shot an arrow straight into the target.","zh":"射箭手把箭直直射進靶心。"},{"en":"Follow the red arrow to find the exit.","zh":"跟著紅色箭頭走就能找到出口。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["narrow","arrive"]},"article":{"ex":[{"en":"I read an interesting article about climate change today.","zh":"我今天讀了一篇關於氣候變遷的有趣文章。"},{"en":"The newspaper article described the festival in detail.","zh":"這篇報紙文章詳細描述了這個節慶。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["artist","particle"]},"artist":{"ex":[{"en":"She is a talented artist who paints landscapes.","zh":"她是一位很有才華的畫家，專門畫風景。"},{"en":"The street artist sold his paintings to tourists.","zh":"那位街頭藝術家把畫賣給遊客。"}],"hook":"art 藝術 + -ist 表示人","confuse":["article","artistic"]},"asleep":{"ex":[{"en":"The baby fell asleep in the car on the way home.","zh":"寶寶在回家的車上睡著了。"},{"en":"He was still asleep when the alarm went off.","zh":"鬧鐘響時他還在睡覺。"}],"hook":"a- 處於 + sleep 睡","confuse":["sleep","sleepy"]},"attempt":{"ex":[{"en":"She made a second attempt to pass the driving test.","zh":"她第二次嘗試通過駕照考試。"},{"en":"Nobody survived the attempt to climb the mountain.","zh":"攀登這座山的企圖中沒有人存活。"}],"hook":"at- 向 + tempt 試探、嘗試","confuse":["attend","tempt"]},"attend":{"ex":[{"en":"Over two hundred guests attended the wedding last night.","zh":"昨晚超過兩百位賓客出席了婚禮。"},{"en":"Will you attend the meeting on Friday morning?","zh":"你星期五早上會參加會議嗎？"}],"hook":"at- 向 + tend 朝向、照料","confuse":["attempt","attention"]},"attention":{"ex":[{"en":"Please pay attention to the teacher during the lecture.","zh":"上課時請專心聽老師講課。"},{"en":"The new advertisement caught everyone's attention.","zh":"這則新廣告吸引了大家的注意。"}],"hook":"attend 的名詞形，-tion 名詞後綴","confuse":["attend","intention"]},"author":{"ex":[{"en":"The author signed copies of her new novel today.","zh":"這位作者今天為她的新小說簽名。"},{"en":"Who is the author of this famous science book?","zh":"這本著名科普書的作者是誰？"}],"hook":"","confuse":["actor","authority"]},"available":{"ex":[{"en":"Tickets are available online until Friday.","zh":"票券可在網路上購買到星期五。"},{"en":"Is this room available for the meeting tomorrow?","zh":"明天開會這間教室可以使用嗎？"}],"hook":"avail 有用 + -able 可以…的","confuse":["valuable","avoid"]},"average":{"ex":[{"en":"The average temperature here in July is thirty degrees.","zh":"這裡七月的平均氣溫是三十度。"},{"en":"My test score was slightly above average this term.","zh":"我這學期的考試成績略高於平均。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"avoid":{"ex":[{"en":"Try to avoid eating junk food before bedtime.","zh":"睡前盡量避免吃垃圾食物。"},{"en":"She avoided her classmate in the hallway after the fight.","zh":"吵架後，她在走廊上刻意避開同學。"}],"hook":"a- 離開 + void 空的，讓自己空出來","confuse":["void","avid"]},"aboard":{"ex":[{"en":"All passengers are now aboard the train.","zh":"所有乘客現在都已上火車。"},{"en":"We went aboard the boat before sunset.","zh":"我們在日落前上了船。"}],"hook":"想像踩上 board（船或車）就 aboard","confuse":["abroad"]},"acceptable":{"ex":[{"en":"Your answer is acceptable, but it needs more detail.","zh":"你的答案可以接受，但需要更詳細。"},{"en":"Jeans are acceptable for the school trip.","zh":"校外教學可以穿牛仔褲。"}],"hook":"accept（接受）+ -able（能夠）：能被接受","confuse":["accessible"]},"accurate":{"ex":[{"en":"The map is accurate and easy to follow.","zh":"這張地圖很精確，也很容易看懂。"},{"en":"Please give an accurate answer.","zh":"請給出準確的答案。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["adequate"]},"ache":{"ex":[{"en":"I have a dull ache in my back.","zh":"我的背隱隱作痛。"},{"en":"The ache in her knee got worse.","zh":"她膝蓋的疼痛加劇了。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["each"]},"achieve":{"ex":[{"en":"She worked hard to achieve her goal.","zh":"她努力實現自己的目標。"},{"en":"You can achieve a lot with practice.","zh":"透過練習，你可以達成很多目標。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["archive"]},"achievement":{"ex":[{"en":"Winning the science fair was her proudest achievement.","zh":"贏得科展是她最引以為傲的成就。"},{"en":"Finishing the race was a big achievement for him.","zh":"跑完全程對他來說是一項很大的成就。"}],"hook":"achieve（達成）+ -ment（名詞字尾）","confuse":["accomplishment","award"]},"ad":{"ex":[{"en":"I saw an ad for a new phone online.","zh":"我在網路上看到一則新手機的廣告。"},{"en":"The ad caught my attention during the show.","zh":"節目播出時，那則廣告引起了我的注意。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["advertisement"]},"additional":{"ex":[{"en":"The hotel charged an additional fee for breakfast.","zh":"這間飯店另外收取早餐費。"},{"en":"Please bring additional water for the trip.","zh":"請多帶一些水，以備旅途所需。"}],"hook":"add（增加）+ -itional（形容詞字尾）","confuse":["extra","extraordinary"]},"admire":{"ex":[{"en":"I admire my sister for her courage.","zh":"我很佩服姊姊的勇氣。"},{"en":"Many students admire their English teacher.","zh":"許多學生都很欣賞他們的英文老師。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["adore","respect"]},"advanced":{"ex":[{"en":"This advanced camera can take clear night photos.","zh":"這台先進的相機能拍出清晰的夜景。"},{"en":"The school has advanced computer equipment.","zh":"這所學校有先進的電腦設備。"}],"hook":"advance（前進、進步）+ -ed（形容詞字尾）","confuse":["developed","modern"]},"advantage":{"ex":[{"en":"Speaking two languages gives her an advantage.","zh":"會說兩種語言讓她占有優勢。"},{"en":"One advantage of cycling is saving money.","zh":"騎腳踏車的一個好處是省錢。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["benefit","disadvantage"]},"adventure":{"ex":[{"en":"Their adventure began with a hike in the mountains.","zh":"他們的冒險之旅從山區健行開始。"},{"en":"The book tells of a sailor's adventure at sea.","zh":"這本書講述一名水手在海上的奇遇。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["adventurous","journey"]},"advertise":{"ex":[{"en":"The shop advertises its sale on social media.","zh":"這家店在社群媒體上宣傳特賣活動。"},{"en":"They advertise the concert on the radio.","zh":"他們在廣播上為這場演唱會打廣告。"}],"hook":"advertise 裡有 ad（廣告）","confuse":["advertisement","advise"]},"advertisement":{"ex":[{"en":"The advertisement appeared in a local newspaper.","zh":"這則廣告刊登在地方報紙上。"},{"en":"We watched an advertisement before the movie.","zh":"電影開始前，我們看了一則廣告。"}],"hook":"advertise（登廣告）+ -ment（名詞字尾）","confuse":["ad","advertising"]},"advise":{"ex":[{"en":"My teacher advised me to get more sleep.","zh":"老師建議我多睡一點。"},{"en":"Doctors advise people to exercise regularly.","zh":"醫生建議大家規律運動。"}],"hook":"advise 以 s 結尾；advice 是名詞","confuse":["advice","advertise"]},"adviser":{"ex":[{"en":"The adviser helped us choose our courses.","zh":"顧問幫我們選擇課程。"},{"en":"Ask your school adviser about college applications.","zh":"大學申請的事可以請教學校顧問。"}],"hook":"advise（建議）+ -er（做這件事的人）","confuse":["advisor","advice"]},"advisor":{"ex":[{"en":"Her advisor helped her plan a study schedule.","zh":"她的顧問幫她規劃讀書進度。"},{"en":"The advisor answered questions about the program.","zh":"顧問回答了有關這個計畫的問題。"}],"hook":"advisor 與 adviser 同義，-or 是另一種拼法","confuse":["adviser","advice"]},"afford":{"ex":[{"en":"We can't afford a new car right now.","zh":"我們現在買不起新車。"},{"en":"She saved money so she could afford the trip.","zh":"她存錢，這樣才負擔得起這趟旅行。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["effort","offer"]},"afterward":{"ex":[{"en":"We ate dinner and went for a walk afterward.","zh":"我們吃完晚餐，之後去散步。"},{"en":"He apologized afterward for being late.","zh":"他後來為遲到道歉。"}],"hook":"after（之後）+ -ward（朝某方向、往後）","confuse":["afterwards","beforehand"]},"afterwards":{"ex":[{"en":"We visited the museum and had lunch afterwards.","zh":"我們參觀博物館，之後去吃午餐。"},{"en":"She called her parents afterwards.","zh":"她後來打電話給爸媽。"}],"hook":"after（之後）+ -wards（朝某方向、往後）","confuse":["afterward","beforehand"]},"agriculture":{"ex":[{"en":"Agriculture is important to the country's economy.","zh":"農業對這個國家的經濟很重要。"},{"en":"Modern agriculture uses machines to save time.","zh":"現代農業利用機器來節省時間。"}],"hook":"agri- 源自拉丁文 ager，意為「田地」","confuse":["agricultural","culture"]},"airline":{"ex":[{"en":"The airline canceled our flight because of the storm.","zh":"這家航空公司因暴風雨取消了我們的班機。"},{"en":"She works for an international airline.","zh":"她在一家國際航空公司工作。"}],"hook":"air（空中）+ line（航線）","confuse":["aircraft","airport"]},"alley":{"ex":[{"en":"A small cat ran into the alley.","zh":"一隻小貓跑進巷子裡。"},{"en":"The restaurant is hidden in a narrow alley.","zh":"那家餐廳藏在一條狹窄的小巷裡。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["ally","valley"]},"almond":{"ex":[{"en":"She added chopped almond to the salad.","zh":"她在沙拉裡加了切碎的杏仁。"},{"en":"This almond cookie goes well with tea.","zh":"這款杏仁餅乾很適合配茶。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["almond milk","nut"]},"alphabet":{"ex":[{"en":"The children sang the alphabet song together.","zh":"孩子們一起唱字母歌。"},{"en":"Write the names in alphabetical order.","zh":"請按字母順序寫下這些名字。"}],"hook":"alpha 和 beta 是希臘字母的名稱","confuse":["letter","alphabetical"]},"amaze":{"ex":[{"en":"The magician's final trick amazed the audience.","zh":"魔術師最後的把戲讓觀眾驚嘆不已。"},{"en":"It amazes me how quickly she learns.","zh":"她學得這麼快，讓我很驚訝。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["amuse"]},"amazement":{"ex":[{"en":"To my amazement, the lost dog came home.","zh":"令我驚訝的是，那隻走失的狗回家了。"},{"en":"He stared at the giant wave in amazement.","zh":"他驚奇地望著那道巨浪。"}],"hook":"amaze（使驚訝）+ -ment（名詞字尾）","confuse":["amusement","surprise"]},"ambassador":{"ex":[{"en":"The ambassador met with local students.","zh":"大使與當地學生會面。"},{"en":"She hopes to become a youth ambassador.","zh":"她希望成為青年大使。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["ambassadorial","representative"]},"ambition":{"ex":[{"en":"Her ambition is to become a doctor.","zh":"她的抱負是成為一名醫生。"},{"en":"He has the ambition to start his own business.","zh":"他有創業的雄心。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["ambitious","goal"]},"ambulance":{"ex":[{"en":"An ambulance took the injured man to the hospital.","zh":"救護車把受傷的男子送往醫院。"},{"en":"Please call an ambulance if someone is badly hurt.","zh":"如果有人嚴重受傷，請叫救護車。"}],"hook":"ambul- 源自拉丁文 ambulare，意為「行走」","confuse":["ambulant","van"]},"angel":{"ex":[{"en":"The little girl dressed as an angel for the school play.","zh":"小女孩在校慶戲劇中打扮成天使。"},{"en":"He thanked the nurse, calling her an angel.","zh":"他稱讚那位護理師像天使一樣，並向她道謝。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["angle"]},"announce":{"ex":[{"en":"The school will announce the winners tomorrow.","zh":"學校明天會公布得獎者。"},{"en":"They announced a change to the bus schedule.","zh":"他們宣布公車時刻表有所更動。"}],"hook":"和 pronounce 共用 -nounce「宣告」字根","confuse":["pronounce","denounce"]},"announcement":{"ex":[{"en":"We heard an announcement about the delayed train.","zh":"我們聽到火車誤點的公告。"},{"en":"The teacher posted an announcement on the class website.","zh":"老師在班級網站上張貼了一則公告。"}],"hook":"announce + -ment，表示「宣布這件事」","confuse":["announce","advertisement"]},"anxious":{"ex":[{"en":"Mia felt anxious before her first speech.","zh":"米雅第一次上台演講前感到很焦慮。"},{"en":"I'm anxious about my exam results.","zh":"我很擔心自己的考試成績。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["eager","nervous"]},"anyhow":{"ex":[{"en":"It was raining, but we went hiking anyhow.","zh":"雖然下著雨，我們還是去爬山了。"},{"en":"I don't know who broke it; anyhow, we should clean up.","zh":"我不知道是誰弄壞的；反正我們該把這裡整理好。"}],"hook":"any + how，帶有「不管怎樣」的語感","confuse":["anyway","somehow"]},"apart":{"ex":[{"en":"The two houses stand only a few meters apart.","zh":"這兩棟房子只相隔幾公尺。"},{"en":"Keep the wet clothes apart from the clean ones.","zh":"把濕衣服和乾淨衣服分開放。"}],"hook":"apart 和 a part 只差空格，意思常相反","confuse":["a part","aside"]},"apologize":{"ex":[{"en":"You should apologize for interrupting her.","zh":"你應該為打斷她說話而道歉。"},{"en":"He apologized to his friend after the argument.","zh":"爭吵過後，他向朋友道歉。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["apology","excuse"]},"appeal":{"ex":[{"en":"The old town has a special appeal for visitors.","zh":"這座古城對遊客有種特別的吸引力。"},{"en":"The simple design is part of the phone's appeal.","zh":"簡約的設計是這支手機吸引人的原因之一。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["attraction","appear"]},"approve":{"ex":[{"en":"My parents approve of my plan to study abroad.","zh":"我父母贊成我出國留學的計畫。"},{"en":"The committee approved the new school rules.","zh":"委員會同意了新的校規。"}],"hook":"approve 和 prove 字形相近；想成「認可這項證明」","confuse":["improve","prove"]},"apron":{"ex":[{"en":"She tied on an apron before baking cookies.","zh":"她烤餅乾前繫上了圍裙。"},{"en":"His apron was covered with flour.","zh":"他的圍裙上沾滿了麵粉。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"armed":{"ex":[{"en":"The guards were armed with rifles.","zh":"警衛配備了步槍。"},{"en":"Police arrested an armed man near the station.","zh":"警方在車站附近逮捕了一名持有武器的男子。"}],"hook":"arm 可指「武器」；armed 就是帶著武器的","confuse":["armored","harmless"]},"arrest":{"ex":[{"en":"Police arrested the driver for stealing a car.","zh":"警方因那名駕駛偷車而將他逮捕。"},{"en":"The officer arrested him outside the store.","zh":"警員在商店外逮捕了他。"}],"hook":"和 rest 同字尾；逮捕會讓人停下來","confuse":["detain","rest"]},"ash":{"ex":[{"en":"The fire left a pile of ash on the ground.","zh":"火災在地上留下一堆灰燼。"},{"en":"She brushed the ash from the fireplace.","zh":"她把壁爐裡的灰燼刷掉。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["ashes"]},"aside":{"ex":[{"en":"Please step aside so others can pass.","zh":"請站到一旁，讓其他人通過。"},{"en":"He pulled me aside to share some news.","zh":"他把我拉到一旁，告訴我一件事。"}],"hook":"把 aside 看成 a + side：移到一邊","confuse":["beside","besides"]},"assist":{"ex":[{"en":"Two students assisted the teacher with the project.","zh":"兩位學生協助老師完成這項專題。"},{"en":"Could you assist me with these boxes?","zh":"你可以幫我搬這些箱子嗎？"}],"hook":"","confuse":["insist","assistance"]},"assistant":{"ex":[{"en":"The doctor's assistant answered the phone.","zh":"醫師的助理接了電話。"},{"en":"Our teaching assistant helped us review the lesson.","zh":"我們的教學助理幫我們複習課程。"}],"hook":"assist + -ant，表示提供協助的人","confuse":["assistance","assist"]},"assume":{"ex":[{"en":"Don't assume he is angry just because he's quiet.","zh":"不要只因為他很安靜，就認定他在生氣。"},{"en":"I assumed the shop was open on Sundays.","zh":"我原本以為那家店星期天有營業。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["presume","consume"]},"athlete":{"ex":[{"en":"The athlete trained every day for the race.","zh":"那位運動員每天為比賽訓練。"},{"en":"She hopes to become a professional athlete.","zh":"她希望成為職業運動員。"}],"hook":"源自希臘語 athlon「競賽」","confuse":["athletic"]},"attitude":{"ex":[{"en":"A positive attitude can help you face challenges.","zh":"正向的態度能幫助你面對挑戰。"},{"en":"His attitude toward homework has changed.","zh":"他對待作業的態度改變了。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["aptitude"]},"attract":{"ex":[{"en":"Bright flowers attract butterflies to the garden.","zh":"鮮豔的花朵會吸引蝴蝶到花園裡。"},{"en":"The festival attracts visitors from across Taiwan.","zh":"這個節慶吸引來自全台各地的遊客。"}],"hook":"tract 有「拉」的詞根；attract 把目光拉過來","confuse":["distract","attack"]},"attractive":{"ex":[{"en":"The small town is attractive to young families.","zh":"這座小鎮對年輕家庭很有吸引力。"},{"en":"She wore an attractive blue dress to the party.","zh":"她穿了一件迷人的藍色洋裝去參加派對。"}],"hook":"attract + -ive，表示「能吸引人的」","confuse":["attract","attraction"]},"audience":{"ex":[{"en":"The audience clapped loudly after the performance.","zh":"表演結束後，觀眾大聲鼓掌。"},{"en":"She spoke clearly so the audience could hear her.","zh":"她說得很清楚，讓聽眾都聽得見。"}],"hook":"aud- 是「聽」的字根，如 audio","confuse":["audio","auditorium"]},"auto":{"ex":[{"en":"He saved money for a used auto.","zh":"他存錢要買一輛二手車。"},{"en":"The auto stopped beside the curb.","zh":"那輛汽車停在路邊。"}],"hook":"auto 是 automobile 的常見簡稱","confuse":["automatic","automobile"]},"automatic":{"ex":[{"en":"The door closes automatically after you leave.","zh":"你離開後，門會自動關上。"},{"en":"This camera has an automatic focus setting.","zh":"這台相機有自動對焦設定。"}],"hook":"auto- 是「自己」，如 automatic「自己運作的」","confuse":["automobile","manual"]},"automobile":{"ex":[{"en":"Their automobile broke down on the highway.","zh":"他們的汽車在高速公路上故障了。"},{"en":"The museum displays a century-old automobile.","zh":"博物館展示一輛有百年歷史的汽車。"}],"hook":"auto-「自己」+ mobile「可移動的」","confuse":["auto","automatic"]},"avenue":{"ex":[{"en":"The parade moved slowly down the avenue.","zh":"遊行隊伍慢慢地沿著大街前進。"},{"en":"A café opened on the busy avenue.","zh":"熱鬧的大道上開了一間咖啡館。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["street"]},"awake":{"ex":[{"en":"I stayed awake until midnight.","zh":"我一直醒著到半夜。"},{"en":"The baby is awake and smiling.","zh":"寶寶醒著，還露出笑容。"}],"hook":"awake 裡的 wake 是「醒來」","confuse":["awaken","asleep"]},"awaken":{"ex":[{"en":"The loud alarm awakened me at six.","zh":"吵鬧的鬧鐘六點把我叫醒。"},{"en":"A cold splash of water awakened him.","zh":"一潑冷水讓他醒了過來。"}],"hook":"awaken 含有 wake「醒來」","confuse":["awake","wake"]},"award":{"ex":[{"en":"She received an award for her science project.","zh":"她因為科展作品獲得了一個獎項。"},{"en":"The school gave him an award for courage.","zh":"學校頒給他一個勇氣獎。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["reward","rewarding"]},"aware":{"ex":[{"en":"Are you aware of the new school rule?","zh":"你知道新的校規嗎？"},{"en":"She became aware of someone behind her.","zh":"她察覺到身後有人。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["beware","awake"]},"awful":{"ex":[{"en":"The weather was awful during our picnic.","zh":"我們野餐時天氣糟透了。"},{"en":"I made an awful mistake on the test.","zh":"我考試時犯了一個很糟糕的錯誤。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["awesome","awfully"]},"awkward":{"ex":[{"en":"There was an awkward silence after his joke.","zh":"他講完笑話後，現場一陣尷尬的沉默。"},{"en":"I felt awkward meeting my teacher at the mall.","zh":"在購物中心遇到老師，讓我覺得很尷尬。"}],"hook":"awkward 聯想「啊，好怪」的窘樣","confuse":["backward","inward"]},"abandon":{"ex":[{"en":"They had to abandon the plan because of the storm.","zh":"因為暴風雨，他們只好放棄這項計畫。"},{"en":"The family abandoned the old house years ago.","zh":"那家人幾年前就遺棄了那棟老房子。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["abundant","abandonment"]},"absolute":{"ex":[{"en":"The coach demanded absolute silence during practice.","zh":"教練要求練習時完全保持安靜。"},{"en":"We need absolute trust to work together.","zh":"我們需要完全信任，才能一起合作。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["obsolete","absolutely"]},"absorb":{"ex":[{"en":"Dry towels absorb water quickly.","zh":"乾毛巾吸水很快。"},{"en":"It took me time to absorb all the new information.","zh":"我花了一些時間才吸收所有新資訊。"}],"hook":"想像海綿把水一口氣吸進去。","confuse":["adsorb","observe"]},"abstract":{"ex":[{"en":"The students discussed an abstract idea about freedom.","zh":"學生討論了一個關於自由的抽象概念。"},{"en":"Abstract art does not always show real objects.","zh":"抽象藝術不一定會描繪真實物體。"}],"hook":"tract 有「拉」的字源；把概念從實物中拉出來。","confuse":["absurd","attract"]},"academic":{"ex":[{"en":"She won an award for her academic work.","zh":"她因學業表現獲得一個獎項。"},{"en":"The school offers academic support after class.","zh":"學校提供課後學業輔導。"}],"hook":"academic 和 academy（學院）同源，聯想到學術。","confuse":["academy","economical"]},"accent":{"ex":[{"en":"He speaks English with a Taiwanese accent.","zh":"他說英語帶有台灣口音。"},{"en":"Her accent changed after living abroad for years.","zh":"她在國外住了多年後，口音變了。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["ascent","accentuate"]},"acceptance":{"ex":[{"en":"Her acceptance into the university made her family proud.","zh":"她獲大學錄取，讓家人感到驕傲。"},{"en":"The club showed acceptance of new members.","zh":"社團接納了新成員。"}],"hook":"accept「接受」加上 -ance，變成名詞。","confuse":["access","exception"]},"access":{"ex":[{"en":"Students have access to the library after school.","zh":"學生放學後可以使用圖書館。"},{"en":"This card gives you access to the building.","zh":"這張卡讓你有權進入這棟大樓。"}],"hook":"access 有「走近」的字源，想成走到門口取得使用權。","confuse":["excess","assess"]},"accidental":{"ex":[{"en":"The broken window was an accidental result of the game.","zh":"窗戶破掉是那場遊戲意外造成的結果。"},{"en":"I made an accidental copy of the wrong file.","zh":"我不小心複製了錯誤的檔案。"}],"hook":"accident「意外」加上形容詞字尾 -al。","confuse":["incident","intentional"]},"accompany":{"ex":[{"en":"Her older brother accompanied her to the clinic.","zh":"她哥哥陪她去診所。"},{"en":"Soft music accompanied the dancers on stage.","zh":"柔和的音樂伴隨舞者在舞台上演出。"}],"hook":"想像有人一路陪在你身旁，和你同行。","confuse":["company","accomplish"]},"accomplish":{"ex":[{"en":"We accomplished our goal before the deadline.","zh":"我們在期限前達成了目標。"},{"en":"She accomplished a lot during the summer break.","zh":"她在暑假期間完成了很多事。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["accompany","complete"]},"accomplishment":{"ex":[{"en":"Winning the contest was a great accomplishment.","zh":"贏得比賽是一項很大的成就。"},{"en":"He listed each accomplishment on his résumé.","zh":"他在履歷上列出每一項成就。"}],"hook":"accomplish「完成」加上 -ment，表示完成的成果。","confuse":["accomplish","achievement"]},"accountant":{"ex":[{"en":"The accountant checked the company's monthly expenses.","zh":"會計人員核對了公司的每月支出。"},{"en":"My aunt works as an accountant at a bank.","zh":"我阿姨在銀行擔任會計師。"}],"hook":"account「帳目」加上表示人的 -ant，就是處理帳目的人。","confuse":["account","countant"]},"accuracy":{"ex":[{"en":"Accuracy matters in science.","zh":"準確性在科學研究中很重要。"},{"en":"The report lacks accuracy.","zh":"這份報告不夠準確。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["precision","accurate"]},"accuse":{"ex":[{"en":"They accused him of stealing the bike.","zh":"他們指控他偷了那輛腳踏車。"},{"en":"She accused me of ignoring her.","zh":"她指責我故意不理她。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["excuse","charge"]},"acid":{"ex":[{"en":"The lemon juice contains acid.","zh":"檸檬汁含有酸。"},{"en":"Wear gloves when handling this acid.","zh":"處理這種酸時要戴手套。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["base","acidic"]},"acquaintance":{"ex":[{"en":"I met an old acquaintance at the station.","zh":"我在車站遇到一位舊識。"},{"en":"He is a casual acquaintance, not a close friend.","zh":"他只是普通熟人，不是親密的朋友。"}],"hook":"acquaint（使認識）+ -ance（狀態）","confuse":["friend","acquaint"]},"acquire":{"ex":[{"en":"She acquired new skills during the internship.","zh":"她在實習期間學會了新技能。"},{"en":"The museum acquired a rare painting.","zh":"這間博物館取得了一幅稀有畫作。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["require","inquire"]},"adapt":{"ex":[{"en":"It took him a month to adapt to school life.","zh":"他花了一個月才適應學校生活。"},{"en":"Animals adapt to changes in their environment.","zh":"動物會適應環境的變化。"}],"hook":"ad- 朝向 + apt 合適","confuse":["adopt","adept"]},"addict":{"ex":[{"en":"He became a video game addict.","zh":"他成了電玩迷。"},{"en":"The clinic helps every addict rebuild a healthy life.","zh":"這間診所幫助每位成癮者重建健康生活。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["addiction","devotee"]},"adequate":{"ex":[{"en":"We have adequate food for the trip.","zh":"我們有足夠的食物可以應付這趟旅程。"},{"en":"The room is adequate for a small meeting.","zh":"這間房間適合舉行小型會議。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["sufficient","appropriate"]},"adjust":{"ex":[{"en":"Please adjust the mirror before driving.","zh":"開車前請調整後照鏡。"},{"en":"He adjusted the volume on the radio.","zh":"他調整了收音機的音量。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["adapt","alter"]},"adjustment":{"ex":[{"en":"The chair needs a small adjustment.","zh":"這張椅子需要稍微調整一下。"},{"en":"Moving to a new city takes adjustment.","zh":"搬到新城市需要一段適應期。"}],"hook":"adjust + -ment（表示動作或結果）","confuse":["change","adaptation"]},"admirable":{"ex":[{"en":"Her patience with the children is admirable.","zh":"她對孩子們的耐心令人欽佩。"},{"en":"It was admirable of him to admit his mistake.","zh":"他願意承認錯誤，這點值得讚賞。"}],"hook":"admire 源自 mirari「驚嘆」","confuse":["commendable"]},"admiration":{"ex":[{"en":"I have great admiration for her courage.","zh":"我非常欽佩她的勇氣。"},{"en":"His hard work earned the team's admiration.","zh":"他的努力贏得了團隊的讚賞。"}],"hook":"admire + -ation（表示動作或狀態）","confuse":["admirable","adoration"]},"admission":{"ex":[{"en":"Admission to the museum is free.","zh":"這間博物館免費入場。"},{"en":"She received admission to the university.","zh":"她獲得了這所大學的入學許可。"}],"hook":"admit（允許進入）+ -sion","confuse":["permission","admittance"]},"adopt":{"ex":[{"en":"They decided to adopt a baby.","zh":"他們決定收養一個嬰兒。"},{"en":"The couple adopted two children last year.","zh":"這對夫妻去年收養了兩個孩子。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["adapt","adept"]},"agency":{"ex":[{"en":"We booked the tour through a travel agency.","zh":"我們透過旅行社預訂了行程。"},{"en":"The agency represents several local brands.","zh":"這間代理機構代理好幾個本地品牌。"}],"hook":"agent（代理人）+ -cy（身分或機構）","confuse":["agent","agenda"]},"agent":{"ex":[{"en":"Her agent negotiated a better contract.","zh":"她的經紀人談到了一份更好的合約。"},{"en":"A real estate agent showed us the apartment.","zh":"房仲帶我們看了那間公寓。"}],"hook":"agent 源自 agere「做事」","confuse":["agency","actor"]},"aggressive":{"ex":[{"en":"The dog became aggressive when strangers approached.","zh":"陌生人靠近時，那隻狗變得很有攻擊性。"},{"en":"The team used an aggressive strategy.","zh":"這支隊伍採取了積極進取的策略。"}],"hook":"ag- 朝向 + gress 踏步，有向前逼近的感覺","confuse":["assertive","offensive"]},"agreeable":{"ex":[{"en":"The weather was warm and agreeable.","zh":"天氣溫暖宜人。"},{"en":"We had an agreeable conversation over lunch.","zh":"我們午餐時聊得很愉快。"}],"hook":"agree（同意）+ -able（能……的）","confuse":["pleasant","acceptable"]},"alcohol":{"ex":[{"en":"This drink contains no alcohol.","zh":"這種飲料不含酒精。"},{"en":"Alcohol can affect your judgment.","zh":"酒精會影響你的判斷力。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["alcoholic","ethanol"]},"alert":{"ex":[{"en":"Stay alert while crossing the street.","zh":"過馬路時要保持警覺。"},{"en":"The guard remained alert all night.","zh":"警衛整晚都保持警戒。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["aware","alarmed"]},"allowance":{"ex":[{"en":"My parents give me a weekly allowance.","zh":"我爸媽每週給我零用錢。"},{"en":"She saved half her allowance for a new bike.","zh":"她把一半的零用錢存起來，想買一輛新腳踏車。"}],"hook":"allow（給予）+ -ance（表示動作或結果）","confuse":["salary","loan"]},"alternative":{"ex":[{"en":"We need an alternative to plastic bags.","zh":"我們需要塑膠袋的替代方案。"},{"en":"Taking the bus is a cheaper alternative.","zh":"搭公車是比較便宜的選擇。"}],"hook":"alter 有「其他的、不同的」之意","confuse":["option","alternate"]},"amateur":{"ex":[{"en":"She is an amateur photographer.","zh":"她是業餘攝影愛好者。"},{"en":"The race is open to amateur runners.","zh":"這場賽事開放給業餘跑者參加。"}],"hook":"源自拉丁語 amator「愛好者」","confuse":["professional","beginner"]},"ambiguous":{"ex":[{"en":"His answer was ambiguous and confused everyone.","zh":"他的回答模稜兩可，讓大家都很困惑。"},{"en":"The instructions are ambiguous about where to meet.","zh":"說明沒有清楚指出要在哪裡集合。"}],"hook":"ambi- 表「兩邊」，像有兩種解讀","confuse":["vague","ambivalent"]},"ambitious":{"ex":[{"en":"She is ambitious and hopes to lead the team.","zh":"她很有抱負，希望帶領這支隊伍。"},{"en":"His ambitious plan requires more time.","zh":"他那項雄心勃勃的計畫需要更多時間。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["aspiring","ambiguous"]},"amuse":{"ex":[{"en":"The clown tried to amuse the children.","zh":"小丑試著逗孩子們開心。"},{"en":"Her silly story amused everyone at dinner.","zh":"她那個傻氣的故事逗得晚餐桌上的大家哈哈大笑。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["amusement","amaze"]},"amusement":{"ex":[{"en":"The board game provided hours of amusement.","zh":"這款桌遊帶來好幾個小時的樂趣。"},{"en":"The children watched the puppets with amusement.","zh":"孩子們饒有興味地看著布偶戲。"}],"hook":"amuse 逗樂 + -ment，記成「逗樂帶來的樂趣」","confuse":["amuse","entertainment"]},"analysis":{"ex":[{"en":"Her analysis of the poem revealed its hidden meaning.","zh":"她對這首詩的分析揭示了其中隱藏的意義。"},{"en":"The team shared its analysis of the survey results.","zh":"團隊分享了對問卷結果的分析。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["analyze","analyst"]},"analyze":{"ex":[{"en":"We need to analyze the data before drawing conclusions.","zh":"我們需要先分析資料，再下結論。"},{"en":"The students analyzed the character’s choices.","zh":"學生分析了這個角色的選擇。"}],"hook":"analyze 是動詞；analysis 是它的名詞","confuse":["analysis","paralyze"]},"ancestor":{"ex":[{"en":"One of my ancestors came from Tainan.","zh":"我的一位祖先來自台南。"},{"en":"The family tree shows where our ancestors lived.","zh":"這份族譜顯示了我們祖先曾居住的地方。"}],"hook":"ante- 是「在前」，祖先就是走在你前面的人","confuse":["descendant","ancient"]},"anniversary":{"ex":[{"en":"They celebrated their tenth wedding anniversary in May.","zh":"他們在五月慶祝結婚十週年。"},{"en":"Our school holds a concert every anniversary.","zh":"我們學校每逢校慶都會舉辦音樂會。"}],"hook":"annus 是拉丁文「年」；anniversary 每年繞回同一天","confuse":["annual","birthday"]},"annoy":{"ex":[{"en":"The loud music began to annoy our neighbors.","zh":"吵鬧的音樂開始惹惱鄰居。"},{"en":"It annoys me when people interrupt.","zh":"別人插話時，我會覺得很煩。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["irritate","enjoy"]},"annual":{"ex":[{"en":"Our annual school festival takes place in October.","zh":"我們一年一度的校慶在十月舉行。"},{"en":"The club publishes an annual report.","zh":"這個社團每年都會出版一份年度報告。"}],"hook":"annus 是拉丁文「年」；annual 帶有「年」的意思","confuse":["anniversary","yearly"]},"anxiety":{"ex":[{"en":"She felt anxiety before the important interview.","zh":"重要面試前，她感到很焦慮。"},{"en":"Talking with a friend eased his anxiety.","zh":"和朋友聊一聊，讓他的焦慮減輕了。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["anxious","worry"]},"apology":{"ex":[{"en":"He offered an apology for arriving late.","zh":"他為遲到向大家道歉。"},{"en":"A sincere apology can help repair a friendship.","zh":"真誠的道歉有助於修復友誼。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["apologize","apologetic"]},"apparent":{"ex":[{"en":"It was apparent that Mia had practiced hard.","zh":"很明顯，米雅練習得很勤。"},{"en":"The mistake became apparent after we checked the totals.","zh":"我們核對總數後，錯誤就顯而易見了。"}],"hook":"appear「出現」+ -ent；像是顯現在眼前的","confuse":["evident","apparently"]},"applicant":{"ex":[{"en":"Each applicant must submit a writing sample.","zh":"每位申請人都必須繳交一份寫作樣本。"},{"en":"The company interviewed three applicants yesterday.","zh":"公司昨天面試了三位應徵者。"}],"hook":"apply「申請」+ -ant，指提出申請的人","confuse":["application","employee"]},"application":{"ex":[{"en":"Please send your application by Friday.","zh":"請在星期五前寄出你的申請書。"},{"en":"She filled out an application for the summer program.","zh":"她填寫了暑期課程的申請表。"}],"hook":"apply「申請」+ -ation，指申請這件事或申請書","confuse":["applicant","appliance"]},"appoint":{"ex":[{"en":"The principal appointed Leo as class leader.","zh":"校長指派里歐擔任班長。"},{"en":"They appointed a new director last week.","zh":"他們上週任命了一位新主管。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["appointment","assign"]},"appointment":{"ex":[{"en":"I have a dentist appointment at three.","zh":"我三點有牙醫預約。"},{"en":"She made an appointment to see the school counselor.","zh":"她預約要和學校輔導老師見面。"}],"hook":"appoint「指派、安排」+ -ment；也可指安排好的會面","confuse":["appoint","date"]},"appreciation":{"ex":[{"en":"We showed our appreciation with a thank-you card.","zh":"我們送上感謝卡，表達謝意。"},{"en":"Her appreciation for the volunteers meant a lot.","zh":"她對志工的感謝讓大家很感動。"}],"hook":"appreciate「感謝」+ -ation，指感謝之情","confuse":["appreciate","apology"]},"appropriate":{"ex":[{"en":"Jeans are not appropriate for the formal ceremony.","zh":"牛仔褲不適合穿去正式典禮。"},{"en":"The teacher chose an appropriate book for beginners.","zh":"老師為初學者挑了一本合適的書。"}],"hook":"拆出 proper「合乎規矩的」，幫你記住 appropriate 的意思","confuse":["proper","inappropriate"]},"approval":{"ex":[{"en":"The plan needs approval from the school board.","zh":"這項計畫需要校務會議同意。"},{"en":"Her parents gave their approval for the trip.","zh":"她的父母同意她去旅行。"}],"hook":"approve「贊成」+ -al，approval 是贊成或同意","confuse":["approve","disapproval"]},"aquarium":{"ex":[{"en":"We saw a giant octopus at the aquarium.","zh":"我們在水族館看到一隻巨大的章魚。"},{"en":"The aquarium is home to many tropical fish.","zh":"這座水族館裡住著許多熱帶魚。"}],"hook":"aqua 是拉丁文「水」；aquarium 是養水中生物的地方","confuse":["aquatic","terrarium"]},"arch":{"ex":[{"en":"We walked beneath the stone arch.","zh":"我們從石拱門下走過。"},{"en":"The old bridge has a graceful arch.","zh":"這座古老的橋有一道優美的拱形。"}],"hook":"想像石塊排成彎彎的弧線，跨在通道上","confuse":["arc","archway"]},"arise":{"ex":[{"en":"New problems may arise during the project.","zh":"計畫進行時可能會出現新的問題。"}],"hook":"a- + rise；問題像是從平地升起、冒出來","confuse":["rise","raise"]},"arms":{"ex":[{"en":"The soldiers laid down their arms.","zh":"士兵們放下了武器。"},{"en":"The country agreed not to sell arms to the rebels.","zh":"該國同意不向叛軍出售軍火。"}],"hook":"arms 也可指「手臂」；想像手臂拿著武器","confuse":["weapons","arms (body parts)"]},"artificial":{"ex":[{"en":"The flowers look real, but they are artificial.","zh":"這些花看起來像真的，但其實是人造的。"},{"en":"The patient received an artificial heart valve.","zh":"病人裝上了一個人工心臟瓣膜。"}],"hook":"art「技藝」+ facere「製作」；人工做出來的","confuse":["natural","artistic"]},"artistic":{"ex":[{"en":"Her artistic talent was clear from a young age.","zh":"她從小就展現出藝術天分。"},{"en":"The café has an artistic design.","zh":"這家咖啡廳的設計很有藝術感。"}],"hook":"art「藝術」+ -istic，形容和藝術有關的","confuse":["artificial","artist"]},"ashamed":{"ex":[{"en":"He felt ashamed of his rude behavior.","zh":"他為自己無禮的行為感到羞愧。"},{"en":"I was ashamed that I had lied to her.","zh":"我因為對她說謊而感到慚愧。"}],"hook":"ashamed 裡有 shame「羞恥」","confuse":["shameful","embarrassed"]},"aspect":{"ex":[{"en":"One aspect of the job is working with people.","zh":"這份工作的一個層面是與人相處。"},{"en":"We discussed every aspect of the plan.","zh":"我們討論了這項計畫的各個方面。"}],"hook":"spect＝看；aspect 是看事情的角度","confuse":["respect","expect"]},"aspirin":{"ex":[{"en":"I took aspirin for my headache.","zh":"我吃了阿斯匹靈來治頭痛。"},{"en":"The doctor told him to take aspirin after meals.","zh":"醫生叫他飯後服用阿斯匹靈。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["medicine","antibiotic"]},"assemble":{"ex":[{"en":"Students assembled in the gym before the ceremony.","zh":"學生在典禮前集合在體育館。"},{"en":"We assembled the chairs in a circle.","zh":"我們把椅子排成一圈。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["resemble","gather"]},"assembly":{"ex":[{"en":"Our school holds an assembly every Monday.","zh":"我們學校每週一都會舉行集會。"},{"en":"The principal spoke at the morning assembly.","zh":"校長在早上的集會上致詞。"}],"hook":"assemble 加 -y，聚集起來形成的集會","confuse":["assemble","meeting"]},"assign":{"ex":[{"en":"The teacher assigned each group a different topic.","zh":"老師指派每組不同的題目。"},{"en":"Please assign a partner to each student.","zh":"請替每位學生分配一位搭檔。"}],"hook":"sign＝標記；assign 是把任務標給某人","confuse":["design","appoint"]},"assignment":{"ex":[{"en":"I finished my history assignment last night.","zh":"我昨晚完成了歷史作業。"},{"en":"This assignment is due on Friday.","zh":"這份作業星期五要交。"}],"hook":"assign 加 -ment，指派的任務或作業","confuse":["assessment","appointment"]},"assistance":{"ex":[{"en":"The new student asked for assistance with the map.","zh":"新同學請人幫忙看地圖。"},{"en":"Thank you for your assistance today.","zh":"謝謝你今天的協助。"}],"hook":"assist 中的 sist 有「站」的意思；站在旁邊幫忙","confuse":["assistant","resistance"]},"associate":{"ex":[{"en":"Many people associate this song with summer.","zh":"很多人會把這首歌和夏天聯想在一起。"},{"en":"I associate that smell with my grandmother’s kitchen.","zh":"我會把那種味道和奶奶的廚房聯想在一起。"}],"hook":"soci＝夥伴；associate 把人或事物連在一起","confuse":["socialize","assume"]},"association":{"ex":[{"en":"She joined the local art association.","zh":"她加入了當地的美術協會。"},{"en":"The association plans a community event.","zh":"這個協會計畫舉辦一場社區活動。"}],"hook":"associate 加 -ion，組成團體的關聯者","confuse":["organization","assistance"]},"assurance":{"ex":[{"en":"The company gave us assurance that the product was safe.","zh":"公司向我們保證產品是安全的。"},{"en":"Her calm voice gave me assurance.","zh":"她平靜的聲音讓我感到安心。"}],"hook":"assure 加 -ance，表示保證或有把握的狀態","confuse":["insurance","assistance"]},"assure":{"ex":[{"en":"I assure you that your secret is safe.","zh":"我向你保證，你的祕密不會外洩。"},{"en":"The coach assured us that we could win.","zh":"教練讓我們確信自己能贏。"}],"hook":"assure 裡有 sure；讓人確信、放心","confuse":["ensure","insure"]},"athletic":{"ex":[{"en":"Mia is athletic and loves playing basketball.","zh":"米雅很擅長運動，也很喜歡打籃球。"},{"en":"The school has several athletic teams.","zh":"學校有好幾支體育校隊。"}],"hook":"athlete 是運動員；athletic 是擅長運動的","confuse":["athlete","athletics"]},"atmosphere":{"ex":[{"en":"The café has a warm and friendly atmosphere.","zh":"這間咖啡廳的氣氛溫馨又親切。"},{"en":"Soft music created a relaxing atmosphere.","zh":"柔和的音樂營造出放鬆的氣氛。"}],"hook":"atmo＝蒸氣，sphere＝球；想像包圍地球的氣層","confuse":["environment","temperature"]},"atom":{"ex":[{"en":"An atom is made of smaller particles.","zh":"原子是由更小的粒子組成的。"},{"en":"A molecule can contain more than one atom.","zh":"一個分子可以包含不只一個原子。"}],"hook":"a-不 + tom 切；atom 原指不可再切","confuse":["atomic","molecule"]},"atomic":{"ex":[{"en":"The museum displayed an atomic model.","zh":"博物館展示了一個原子模型。"},{"en":"They studied the effects of atomic energy.","zh":"他們研究了原子能的影響。"}],"hook":"atom 加 -ic，變成「原子的」","confuse":["atom","atomicity"]},"attach":{"ex":[{"en":"Please attach your photo to the form.","zh":"請把照片附在表格上。"},{"en":"He attached a note to the package.","zh":"他在包裹上貼了一張便條。"}],"hook":"attach 有「接上」的感覺；可把文件附上或繫上","confuse":["attack","detach"]},"attachment":{"ex":[{"en":"She has a strong attachment to her childhood home.","zh":"她對童年住過的家有深厚的感情。"},{"en":"His attachment to the old dog was clear.","zh":"他對那隻老狗的依戀很明顯。"}],"hook":"attach 是接上；感情也會「接」在人身上","confuse":["attainment"]},"attraction":{"ex":[{"en":"The old temple is a popular tourist attraction.","zh":"這座古廟是熱門的觀光景點。"},{"en":"The night market is the town’s main attraction.","zh":"夜市是這個鎮上最吸引人的地方。"}],"hook":"tract＝拉；attraction 像把遊客拉過來的地方","confuse":["attractive","attention"]},"audio":{"ex":[{"en":"We listened to the audio guide at the museum.","zh":"我們在博物館聽了語音導覽。"},{"en":"The audio file is too large to send.","zh":"這個音訊檔太大，無法寄出。"}],"hook":"aud＝聽；audio 和聲音、聆聽有關","confuse":["video","audience"]},"authentic":{"ex":[{"en":"This restaurant serves authentic Taiwanese food.","zh":"這間餐廳供應道地的台灣料理。"},{"en":"The museum confirmed that the painting was authentic.","zh":"博物館證實這幅畫是真跡。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["genuine","authoritative"]},"authority":{"ex":[{"en":"The local authority closed the road for repairs.","zh":"地方主管機關封閉了這條路進行修繕。"},{"en":"Teachers have authority to set classroom rules.","zh":"老師有權訂定班級規則。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["author","authorization"]},"autobiography":{"ex":[{"en":"She wrote an autobiography about her life as an athlete.","zh":"她寫了一本自傳，分享自己身為運動員的人生。"},{"en":"His autobiography became a bestseller.","zh":"他的自傳成了暢銷書。"}],"hook":"auto 自己 + bio 生命 + graph 書寫＝自傳","confuse":["biography","autograph"]},"autograph":{"ex":[{"en":"The singer signed an autograph for a young fan.","zh":"那位歌手替一名年輕粉絲簽了名。"},{"en":"I asked the actor for his autograph.","zh":"我向那位演員索取親筆簽名。"}],"hook":"auto 自己 + graph 書寫＝親筆簽名","confuse":["autobiography","paragraph"]},"await":{"ex":[{"en":"A surprise awaited us at the end of the trip.","zh":"旅程的最後有個驚喜等著我們。"},{"en":"The students awaited the teacher outside the classroom.","zh":"學生在教室外等候老師。"}],"hook":"await 裡有 wait：等待某事發生","confuse":["awake","avoid"]},"abnormal":{"ex":[{"en":"The test showed an abnormal level of blood sugar.","zh":"檢查顯示血糖值異常。"},{"en":"It is abnormal for the lake to freeze this early.","zh":"湖泊這麼早結冰並不尋常。"}],"hook":"ab-（偏離）+ normal（正常的）","confuse":["unusual","ordinary"]},"abolish":{"ex":[{"en":"The government voted to abolish the outdated law.","zh":"政府表決廢除這項過時的法律。"},{"en":"The school plans to abolish its old uniform policy.","zh":"學校計畫廢止舊的制服規定。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["establish","ban"]},"abortion":{"ex":[{"en":"She discussed abortion options with her doctor.","zh":"她和醫生討論了人工流產的選擇。"},{"en":"The article explains how abortion laws differ by region.","zh":"這篇文章說明各地的墮胎法律有何不同。"}],"hook":"abort（中止）+ -ion（名詞字尾）","confuse":["adoption","abortionist"]},"abrupt":{"ex":[{"en":"The abrupt change in weather surprised everyone.","zh":"天氣突然變化，讓大家都很意外。"},{"en":"Her abrupt departure left us with many questions.","zh":"她突然離開，讓我們滿腹疑問。"}],"hook":"rupt 有「破裂」之意；像變化突然斷開","confuse":["corrupt","sudden"]},"absurd":{"ex":[{"en":"The idea that cats can drive is absurd.","zh":"貓會開車這種想法很荒謬。"},{"en":"It seems absurd to walk there in this rain.","zh":"下這麼大的雨還走路去那裡，實在很可笑。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["ridiculous","abstract"]},"abundant":{"ex":[{"en":"The island has abundant fresh water.","zh":"這座島有豐富的淡水資源。"},{"en":"Wildflowers are abundant in the fields this spring.","zh":"今年春天，田野裡開滿了野花。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["abundance","plentiful"]},"abuse":{"ex":[{"en":"The audit uncovered the abuse of company funds.","zh":"稽核揭露了公司資金遭到濫用。"},{"en":"The abuse of antibiotics can make infections harder to treat.","zh":"濫用抗生素會讓感染更難治療。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["misuse","use"]},"accelerate":{"ex":[{"en":"The car began to accelerate on the open road.","zh":"車子在空曠的道路上開始加速。"},{"en":"New technology can accelerate medical research.","zh":"新科技能促進醫學研究。"}],"hook":"celer 有「快」的意思，如 celerity（迅速）","confuse":["decelerate","accelerator"]},"accessible":{"ex":[{"en":"The museum is accessible by bus and train.","zh":"搭公車和火車都能到達這座博物館。"},{"en":"The website makes its lessons accessible to everyone.","zh":"這個網站讓每個人都能使用它的課程。"}],"hook":"access（進入、使用）+ -ible（能……的）","confuse":["available","inaccessible"]},"accommodate":{"ex":[{"en":"The hall can accommodate up to 300 guests.","zh":"這個大廳最多可容納三百位賓客。"},{"en":"The hotel can accommodate families with young children.","zh":"這間飯店能接待有年幼孩子的家庭。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["accommodation","accumulate"]},"accommodation":{"ex":[{"en":"We found affordable accommodation near the station.","zh":"我們在車站附近找到價格實惠的住處。"},{"en":"The school arranged accommodation for visiting students.","zh":"學校為來訪的學生安排了住宿。"}],"hook":"accommodate（提供住宿）+ -ion（名詞字尾）","confuse":["accommodate","acclamation"]},"accord":{"ex":[{"en":"The two countries reached an accord on trade.","zh":"兩國在貿易問題上達成協議。"},{"en":"Her actions were in accord with her promises.","zh":"她的行動符合自己的承諾。"}],"hook":"accord 與 concord 同源；cord／cor 有「心」之意","confuse":["according","agreement"]},"accounting":{"ex":[{"en":"She is studying accounting at a local university.","zh":"她在一所當地大學讀會計。"},{"en":"Good accounting helps a small business track its costs.","zh":"良好的會計管理能幫助小企業追蹤成本。"}],"hook":"account 裡有 count（計算）","confuse":["accountant","account"]},"acknowledge":{"ex":[{"en":"He acknowledged that he had made a mistake.","zh":"他承認自己犯了錯。"},{"en":"The company acknowledged its role in the problem.","zh":"公司承認自己在這個問題中有責任。"}],"hook":"acknowledge 含有 knowledge（知道）：知道後承認","confuse":["knowledge","admit"]},"acknowledgement":{"ex":[{"en":"Her acknowledgement of the mistake surprised everyone.","zh":"她承認錯誤，讓大家都很意外。"},{"en":"The report includes an acknowledgement of the team's help.","zh":"報告中也承認並感謝了團隊的協助。"}],"hook":"acknowledge（承認）+ -ment（名詞字尾）","confuse":["acknowledge","acquaintance"]},"acquaint":{"ex":[{"en":"The guide will acquaint us with local customs.","zh":"導遊會讓我們熟悉當地的習俗。"},{"en":"This short course will acquaint you with basic coding.","zh":"這門短期課程會讓你熟悉程式設計的基礎。"}],"hook":"常見搭配 acquaint someone with：使某人熟悉……","confuse":["acquaintance","acquire"]},"acquisition":{"ex":[{"en":"The museum announced the acquisition of two ancient paintings.","zh":"博物館宣布取得兩幅古畫。"},{"en":"Language acquisition takes time and practice.","zh":"習得語言需要時間和練習。"}],"hook":"acquire（取得）和 acquisition 同源","confuse":["acquire","acquisitive"]},"activist":{"ex":[{"en":"The activist organized a beach cleanup with local students.","zh":"這位社運人士和當地學生一起舉辦淨灘活動。"},{"en":"An environmental activist spoke at our school.","zh":"一位環保行動主義者在我們學校演講。"}],"hook":"act（行動）+ -ist（從事某事的人）","confuse":["activity","active"]},"acute":{"ex":[{"en":"The drought caused an acute water shortage.","zh":"乾旱造成嚴重的缺水問題。"},{"en":"She felt acute pain in her shoulder.","zh":"她的肩膀感到劇烈疼痛。"}],"hook":"想像尖角刺入，痛感又尖又強烈","confuse":["severe","accute"]},"administration":{"ex":[{"en":"The school administration changed the lunch schedule.","zh":"校方調整了午餐時間表。"},{"en":"Good administration keeps the project on track.","zh":"良好的管理能讓計畫順利進行。"}],"hook":"和 administer（管理、執行）同源","confuse":["administrative","administrator"]},"administrative":{"ex":[{"en":"She handles the school's administrative tasks.","zh":"她負責學校的行政工作。"},{"en":"The office needs more administrative support.","zh":"辦公室需要更多行政支援。"}],"hook":"administration（行政）+ -ive（形容詞字尾）","confuse":["administration","administrator"]},"administrator":{"ex":[{"en":"The administrator approved our request for new computers.","zh":"行政人員核准了我們添購新電腦的申請。"},{"en":"A school administrator welcomed the new students.","zh":"一位校方管理者歡迎新生。"}],"hook":"administrate（管理）+ -or（做事的人）","confuse":["administration","administrative"]},"adolescent":{"ex":[{"en":"The program offers counseling for adolescent students.","zh":"這項計畫為青少年學生提供諮商服務。"},{"en":"Adolescent health deserves more attention.","zh":"青少年的健康值得更多關注。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["adult","adolescence"]},"adore":{"ex":[{"en":"My little sister adores her new puppy.","zh":"我妹妹非常喜歡她的新小狗。"},{"en":"Fans adore the singer for her warm personality.","zh":"粉絲非常喜愛這位歌手親切的個性。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["admire","adorn"]},"adverse":{"ex":[{"en":"The team continued despite adverse weather conditions.","zh":"儘管天氣不佳，隊伍仍繼續前進。"},{"en":"The medicine may have adverse effects.","zh":"這種藥可能會有不良副作用。"}],"hook":"adverse 和 averse 同源，都帶有「轉離」的意思","confuse":["averse","adversity"]},"advocate":{"ex":[{"en":"She is an advocate for equal access to education.","zh":"她是推動教育平等的倡議者。"},{"en":"The advocate defended the community's rights.","zh":"這位擁護者捍衛社區的權益。"}],"hook":"advocacy（倡議）和 advocate 同源","confuse":["advocacy","proponent"]},"affection":{"ex":[{"en":"The child showed affection by hugging her grandfather.","zh":"那個孩子抱了爺爺，表達對他的喜愛。"},{"en":"He has great affection for his hometown.","zh":"他非常熱愛自己的家鄉。"}],"hook":"affect（影響、觸動）+ -ion；感情會觸動人","confuse":["affectionate","effect"]},"agenda":{"ex":[{"en":"The first item on the agenda is the budget.","zh":"議程上的第一項是預算。"},{"en":"We added student safety to tomorrow's agenda.","zh":"我們把學生安全列入明天的議程。"}],"hook":"agenda 原指「要做的事」，可聯想待辦清單","confuse":["schedule","itinerary"]},"aggression":{"ex":[{"en":"The coach warned the players against aggression on the field.","zh":"教練提醒球員不要在場上有攻擊行為。"},{"en":"The country's aggression alarmed its neighbors.","zh":"該國的侵略行動讓鄰國感到不安。"}],"hook":"aggress（攻擊）+ -ion（名詞字尾）","confuse":["aggressive","aggressor"]},"agony":{"ex":[{"en":"He was in agony after breaking his leg.","zh":"他摔斷腿後痛苦不堪。"},{"en":"Waiting for the results felt like pure agony.","zh":"等待結果的過程簡直是煎熬。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["anguish"]},"agricultural":{"ex":[{"en":"The region is known for its agricultural products.","zh":"這個地區以農產品聞名。"},{"en":"Agricultural land surrounds the small village.","zh":"小村莊四周都是農地。"}],"hook":"agriculture（農業）+ -al（形容詞字尾）","confuse":["agriculture","horticultural"]},"aisle":{"ex":[{"en":"Please keep the airplane aisle clear.","zh":"請保持飛機走道暢通。"},{"en":"She walked down the aisle to her seat.","zh":"她沿著走道走向座位。"}],"hook":"aisle 發音像 I'll，想像走道讓人通行","confuse":["isle","isle"]},"alcoholic":{"ex":[{"en":"The restaurant serves alcoholic drinks after six.","zh":"這家餐廳六點後供應含酒精飲料。"},{"en":"He chose an alcoholic cider with dinner.","zh":"他晚餐時選了一杯含酒精的蘋果酒。"}],"hook":"alcohol（酒精）+ -ic（具有……性質的）","confuse":["alcohol","alcoholism"]},"alien":{"ex":[{"en":"The movie features an alien from a distant planet.","zh":"這部電影描寫一個來自遙遠星球的外星人。"},{"en":"The alien communicated through flashing lights.","zh":"那個外星人用閃爍的燈光溝通。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["avian","alienate"]},"allergic":{"ex":[{"en":"I'm allergic to peanuts, so I avoid them.","zh":"我對花生過敏，所以會避開花生。"},{"en":"He is allergic to cats.","zh":"他對貓過敏。"}],"hook":"allergy（過敏）+ -ic（形容詞字尾）","confuse":["allergy"]},"allergy":{"ex":[{"en":"Her allergy makes spring difficult.","zh":"她的過敏讓春天變得很難熬。"},{"en":"The doctor confirmed his food allergy.","zh":"醫生確認他有食物過敏。"}],"hook":"allergic（過敏的）和 allergy 同源","confuse":["allergic","allergen"]},"alliance":{"ex":[{"en":"The two countries formed an alliance for defense.","zh":"兩國組成防衛同盟。"},{"en":"Their alliance helped the team win the championship.","zh":"他們的合作聯盟幫助隊伍贏得冠軍。"}],"hook":"ally（盟友）+ -ance（名詞字尾）","confuse":["ally"]},"allocate":{"ex":[{"en":"The school will allocate more funds to the library.","zh":"學校將撥出更多經費給圖書館。"},{"en":"We allocated ten minutes for questions.","zh":"我們分配了十分鐘來提問。"}],"hook":"allocate 源自「放置」的意思，可想成把資源放到各處","confuse":["allot","locate"]},"ally":{"ex":[{"en":"Canada is a close ally of the United States.","zh":"加拿大是美國的親密盟友。"},{"en":"She found an ally in her science teacher.","zh":"她在科學老師身上找到一位支持她的人。"}],"hook":"ally 發音像 alley（巷子），想像盟友並肩走過巷子","confuse":["alliance","alley"]},"alongside":{"ex":[{"en":"A narrow path runs alongside the river.","zh":"一條狹窄的小路沿著河邊延伸。"},{"en":"She sat alongside her best friend.","zh":"她坐在最好的朋友旁邊。"}],"hook":"along（沿著）+ side（旁邊）","confuse":["beside","along"]},"alter":{"ex":[{"en":"We had to alter our plans because of the rain.","zh":"因為下雨，我們只好修改計畫。"},{"en":"The tailor altered the jacket to fit him.","zh":"裁縫修改了外套，讓它更合身。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["altar","alternate"]},"alternate":{"ex":[{"en":"The two groups meet on alternate Fridays.","zh":"這兩組每隔一個星期五見面。"},{"en":"The pattern uses alternate bands of blue and white.","zh":"這個圖案以藍白相間的條紋組成。"}],"hook":"altern- 有「輪流、交替」之意","confuse":["alternative","alternating"]},"amend":{"ex":[{"en":"The committee amended the proposal after hearing public feedback.","zh":"委員會聽取民眾意見後，修改了提案。"},{"en":"Please amend your essay before submitting it.","zh":"請在交出作文前先修改一下。"}],"hook":"amend 聽似「啊，改」：啊，這條要改","confuse":["emend","mend"]},"ample":{"ex":[{"en":"We have ample time to finish the project.","zh":"我們有充裕的時間完成這個計畫。"},{"en":"The hall offers ample space for everyone.","zh":"這個大廳有足夠的空間容納所有人。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"analyst":{"ex":[{"en":"The analyst studied the company’s financial reports.","zh":"分析師研究了這家公司的財務報告。"},{"en":"A market analyst explained the latest trends.","zh":"市場分析師解釋了最新趨勢。"}],"hook":"analyst = analyze（分析）的人","confuse":["analysis","analyzer"]},"anonymous":{"ex":[{"en":"An anonymous donor gave the school new computers.","zh":"一位匿名捐款者送給學校新的電腦。"},{"en":"She left an anonymous comment online.","zh":"她在網路上留下一則匿名留言。"}],"hook":"anonym- 有「無名」之意","confuse":["unanimous","synonymous"]},"anticipate":{"ex":[{"en":"We anticipate heavy traffic during the holiday.","zh":"我們預料假期間交通會很壅塞。"},{"en":"She anticipated his questions and prepared answers.","zh":"她預料到他的問題，並事先準備好答案。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["participate","expect"]},"antique":{"ex":[{"en":"My grandfather collects antique clocks.","zh":"我爺爺收藏古董鐘。"},{"en":"They found an antique chair at the market.","zh":"他們在市集找到一張古董椅。"}],"hook":"antique 和 antiquity（古代）同源","confuse":["antiquity","unique"]},"applause":{"ex":[{"en":"The audience gave the singer loud applause.","zh":"觀眾熱烈地為那位歌手鼓掌。"},{"en":"Her speech ended with warm applause.","zh":"她的演講在熱烈掌聲中結束。"}],"hook":"applause 是 applaud（鼓掌）的名詞","confuse":["applaud","appliance"]},"appliance":{"ex":[{"en":"This appliance uses less electricity than the old one.","zh":"這台家電比舊的更省電。"},{"en":"The store sells kitchen appliances at low prices.","zh":"這家店以低價販售廚房家電。"}],"hook":"appliance 含 apply（用途、應用），是實用器具","confuse":["application","applause"]},"apt":{"ex":[{"en":"He is apt to forget his keys.","zh":"他很容易忘記帶鑰匙。"},{"en":"Young children are apt to ask many questions.","zh":"小孩子常常會問很多問題。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["adept","adopt"]},"architect":{"ex":[{"en":"The architect designed a modern library.","zh":"建築師設計了一座現代化圖書館。"},{"en":"We asked an architect to plan our new home.","zh":"我們請建築師規劃新家。"}],"hook":"archi- 有「主要」之意；建築師是主要建造者","confuse":["architecture","archetype"]},"architecture":{"ex":[{"en":"The city is famous for its traditional architecture.","zh":"這座城市以傳統建築風格聞名。"},{"en":"Modern architecture often uses glass and steel.","zh":"現代建築常使用玻璃和鋼材。"}],"hook":"architect（建築師）+ -ure，指建築或建築風格","confuse":["architect","sculpture"]},"arena":{"ex":[{"en":"Thousands of fans filled the arena.","zh":"數千名粉絲擠滿了體育館。"},{"en":"The team entered the arena before the final match.","zh":"決賽前，球隊走進了競技場。"}],"hook":"古羅馬 arena 鋪著沙，供競技使用","confuse":["area","armada"]},"arouse":{"ex":[{"en":"The news aroused strong public interest.","zh":"這則消息引起了大眾的高度關注。"},{"en":"His question aroused my curiosity.","zh":"他的問題激起了我的好奇心。"}],"hook":"arouse 含有 rouse（喚醒），可想成喚起情緒","confuse":["arise","rouse"]},"array":{"ex":[{"en":"The shop displayed an array of colorful hats.","zh":"店裡展示了各式各樣的彩色帽子。"},{"en":"The website offers an array of useful tools.","zh":"這個網站提供了大量實用工具。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["assortment","relay"]},"arrogant":{"ex":[{"en":"The arrogant player refused to listen to his coach.","zh":"那位傲慢的球員不肯聽教練的話。"},{"en":"She sounded arrogant when she dismissed their ideas.","zh":"她不理會他們的想法時，聽起來很自大。"}],"hook":"arrogant 和 arrogate（僭取）同源，像把功勞全攬走","confuse":["ignorant","arrogance"]},"articulate":{"ex":[{"en":"He is articulate and explains complex ideas clearly.","zh":"他口才很好，能清楚解釋複雜的想法。"},{"en":"The articulate student spoke confidently at the meeting.","zh":"那位表達清楚的學生在會議上自信地發言。"}],"hook":"articul- 有「關節」之意；把想法一節節說清楚","confuse":["artistic","artificial"]},"ass":{"ex":[{"en":"The farmer loaded a sack onto the ass.","zh":"農夫把一袋東西放到驢子背上。"},{"en":"An ass carried supplies along the mountain path.","zh":"一頭驢子沿著山路運送物資。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["donkey","ash"]},"assault":{"ex":[{"en":"The man was arrested for assault.","zh":"那名男子因攻擊他人而遭到逮捕。"},{"en":"The victim reported the assault to the police.","zh":"受害者向警方報告了這起襲擊事件。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["insult","assail"]},"assert":{"ex":[{"en":"She asserted that the report was accurate.","zh":"她堅稱這份報告內容正確。"},{"en":"He asserted his right to speak.","zh":"他堅持自己有發言的權利。"}],"hook":"assert 聽似「我說是」：堅定地說自己認為的事","confuse":["insert","assertive"]},"assess":{"ex":[{"en":"Teachers assess students’ progress throughout the year.","zh":"老師全年都會評估學生的學習進度。"},{"en":"The doctor assessed her condition carefully.","zh":"醫生仔細評估了她的狀況。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["access","asset"]},"assessment":{"ex":[{"en":"The assessment showed that his reading had improved.","zh":"評估結果顯示他的閱讀能力進步了。"},{"en":"Students completed a short assessment after the lesson.","zh":"學生在課後完成了一份簡短的評量。"}],"hook":"assess（評估）+ -ment，表示評估的結果或過程","confuse":["assignment","assess"]},"asset":{"ex":[{"en":"The house is their most valuable asset.","zh":"這棟房子是他們最有價值的資產。"},{"en":"Her language skills are a great asset to the team.","zh":"她的語言能力是團隊的一大優勢。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["access","assess"]},"assumption":{"ex":[{"en":"We made the assumption that everyone had arrived.","zh":"我們假設大家都已經到了。"},{"en":"That assumption turned out to be wrong.","zh":"那個假設後來證明是錯的。"}],"hook":"assume（假定）+ -tion，變成「假定、假設」","confuse":["presumption","consumption"]},"astonish":{"ex":[{"en":"The magician’s final trick astonished the audience.","zh":"魔術師最後的戲法讓觀眾大吃一驚。"},{"en":"Her sudden success astonished everyone.","zh":"她突然成功，讓所有人都很驚訝。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["astound","astonished"]},"astonishment":{"ex":[{"en":"To my astonishment, the quiet student won the singing contest.","zh":"令我驚訝的是，那位安靜的學生竟然贏得歌唱比賽。"},{"en":"She stared at the huge cake in astonishment.","zh":"她驚訝地盯著那個大蛋糕。"}],"hook":"astonish + -ment：讓人驚訝的狀態","confuse":["astonish","amusement"]},"athletics":{"ex":[{"en":"Athletics is popular at our school, especially track and field.","zh":"田徑運動在我們學校很受歡迎，尤其是田徑項目。"},{"en":"She received an award for her achievements in athletics.","zh":"她因田徑方面的成就獲得獎項。"}],"hook":"athlete 運動員 + -ics：運動項目","confuse":["athlete","athletic"]},"attendance":{"ex":[{"en":"The teacher checks attendance before every class.","zh":"老師每堂課前都會點名。"},{"en":"Attendance at the school concert was higher than expected.","zh":"學校音樂會的出席人數比預期多。"}],"hook":"attend 出席 + -ance：出席這件事","confuse":["attend","attention","attendant"]},"attic":{"ex":[{"en":"We found old family photos in the attic.","zh":"我們在閣樓找到家裡的老照片。"},{"en":"The attic gets very hot in summer.","zh":"夏天閣樓會變得非常熱。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["addict"]},"attorney":{"ex":[{"en":"The attorney explained the contract to her client.","zh":"律師向客戶解釋這份合約。"},{"en":"He hired an attorney to help with the case.","zh":"他聘請律師協助處理這個案件。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["authority"]},"attribute":{"ex":[{"en":"She attributes her success to hard work and good advice.","zh":"她把成功歸功於努力和良好的建議。"},{"en":"The coach attributed the loss to poor communication.","zh":"教練把這場失利歸因於溝通不良。"}],"hook":"attribute A to B：把 A 歸到 B 名下","confuse":["contribute","distribute","tribute"]},"auction":{"ex":[{"en":"They sold the old painting at an auction.","zh":"他們在一場拍賣會上賣掉那幅老畫。"},{"en":"The auction begins at ten, so arrive early.","zh":"拍賣會十點開始，所以要早點到。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["action","option"]},"authorize":{"ex":[{"en":"Only the manager can authorize a refund.","zh":"只有經理能批准退款。"},{"en":"The school authorized students to use the gym after class.","zh":"學校授權學生下課後使用體育館。"}],"hook":"author 作者有權決定；authorize 授權","confuse":["authority","author"]},"autonomy":{"ex":[{"en":"The students have autonomy in choosing their project topics.","zh":"學生可以自主選擇專題題目。"},{"en":"The region is seeking greater autonomy from the central government.","zh":"該地區正爭取中央政府給予更多自主權。"}],"hook":"auto 自己 + nomy 管理：自己管理","confuse":["astronomy","anatomy"]},"awe":{"ex":[{"en":"The view from the mountain filled us with awe.","zh":"山上的景色讓我們充滿敬畏與驚嘆。"},{"en":"The children watched the fireworks in awe.","zh":"孩子們驚嘆地看著煙火。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["awesome","awful"]},"abbreviate":{"ex":[{"en":"You can abbreviate the name to save space.","zh":"你可以把這個名稱縮寫，以節省空間。"},{"en":"The teacher asked us to abbreviate the long title.","zh":"老師要我們把這個很長的標題簡寫。"}],"hook":"brev-＝短（如 brief）；把長詞變短","confuse":["abridge","acronym"]},"abide":{"ex":[{"en":"All visitors must abide by the safety rules.","zh":"所有訪客都必須遵守安全規定。"},{"en":"She promised to abide by the agreement.","zh":"她答應會遵守協議。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["obey","reside"]},"aboriginal":{"ex":[{"en":"The museum displays Aboriginal art from Australia.","zh":"這間博物館展出澳洲原住民藝術。"},{"en":"We learned about Aboriginal communities in class.","zh":"我們在課堂上認識了原住民族群。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["original","aborigine"]},"abound":{"ex":[{"en":"Wildflowers abound in the hills each spring.","zh":"每年春天，山丘上都開滿野花。"},{"en":"The book abounds with useful examples.","zh":"這本書裡有大量實用的例子。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["around","abundant"]},"abstraction":{"ex":[{"en":"Freedom is an abstraction that means different things to people.","zh":"自由是一種抽象概念，對不同的人有不同意義。"},{"en":"The painting uses color as an abstraction of emotion.","zh":"這幅畫用色彩來抽象呈現情感。"}],"hook":"tract＝拉；把事物共通的特徵抽出來","confuse":["distraction","abstract"]},"abundance":{"ex":[{"en":"The island has an abundance of fresh fruit.","zh":"這座島上有大量的新鮮水果。"},{"en":"An abundance of rain helped the crops grow.","zh":"充沛的雨水讓農作物長得更好。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["abound","abundant"]},"academy":{"ex":[{"en":"She enrolled in a music academy after high school.","zh":"高中畢業後，她進入一所音樂專科學校就讀。"},{"en":"The academy offers courses in science and technology.","zh":"這所學院開設科學與科技課程。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["academic"]},"accessory":{"ex":[{"en":"The phone comes with a useful camera accessory.","zh":"這支手機附有一個實用的相機配件。"},{"en":"She bought a new accessory for her laptop.","zh":"她買了一個新的筆電配件。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["access"]},"acclaim":{"ex":[{"en":"The film received critical acclaim around the world.","zh":"這部電影在世界各地獲得影評界的讚揚。"},{"en":"Her performance earned widespread acclaim.","zh":"她的演出獲得廣泛喝采。"}],"hook":"clam＝喊（如 exclaim）；喝采像是在大聲喊好","confuse":["claim","acclamation"]},"accordance":{"ex":[{"en":"The school acted in accordance with the safety rules.","zh":"學校依照安全規定行事。"},{"en":"In accordance with the map, we turned left at the bridge.","zh":"我們依照地圖，在橋邊左轉。"}],"hook":"accord 有「和諧、一致」之意","confuse":["accordingly","according"]},"accordingly":{"ex":[{"en":"The road was closed, so we accordingly changed our route.","zh":"道路封閉了，所以我們因此改變路線。"},{"en":"She studied hard and was rewarded accordingly.","zh":"她努力讀書，也因此獲得相應的回報。"}],"hook":"accord「一致」+ -ly，依前述情況而行","confuse":["accordance","consequently"]},"accountable":{"ex":[{"en":"Managers are accountable for their team's decisions.","zh":"主管必須為團隊的決定負責。"},{"en":"You must be accountable for what you post online.","zh":"你必須為自己在網路上發布的內容負責。"}],"hook":"account for 有「對……負責」之意","confuse":["account","responsible"]},"accumulate":{"ex":[{"en":"Dust can accumulate under the bed.","zh":"床底下可能會積灰塵。"},{"en":"He accumulated enough points to win a prize.","zh":"他累積了足夠的點數，贏得一個獎品。"}],"hook":"cumulus（積雲）像一層層堆積","confuse":["accumulation","accommodate"]},"accumulation":{"ex":[{"en":"The accumulation of snow blocked the road.","zh":"積雪堵住了道路。"},{"en":"Regular exercise prevents the accumulation of stress.","zh":"規律運動能避免壓力不斷累積。"}],"hook":"cumulus（積雲）像一層層堆積","confuse":["accumulate","accommodation"]},"accusation":{"ex":[{"en":"The accusation shocked everyone in the room.","zh":"這項指控讓在場的每個人都很震驚。"},{"en":"He denied the accusation of cheating.","zh":"他否認作弊的指控。"}],"hook":"accuse（指控）+ -ation（名詞字尾）","confuse":["accuse","allegation"]},"accustom":{"ex":[{"en":"She slowly accustomed herself to life in Taipei.","zh":"她慢慢讓自己適應台北的生活。"},{"en":"It took time to accustom him to the cold weather.","zh":"花了一段時間才讓他習慣寒冷的天氣。"}],"hook":"custom 是「習俗」；讓人熟悉一套習慣","confuse":["custom","accustomed"]},"acne":{"ex":[{"en":"Many teenagers worry about acne.","zh":"許多青少年都會為青春痘煩惱。"},{"en":"This cream may help clear up acne.","zh":"這款乳霜可能有助於改善青春痘。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"acre":{"ex":[{"en":"They bought an acre of land near the lake.","zh":"他們在湖邊買了一英畝的土地。"},{"en":"The garden occupies one acre.","zh":"這座花園占地一英畝。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"adaptation":{"ex":[{"en":"The camel's adaptation to desert life is remarkable.","zh":"駱駝適應沙漠生活的能力令人驚嘆。"},{"en":"His adaptation to living alone took time.","zh":"他花了一段時間才適應獨居生活。"}],"hook":"adapt（調整、適應）+ -ation（名詞字尾）","confuse":["adoption","adaption"]},"addiction":{"ex":[{"en":"His addiction to video games affected his sleep.","zh":"他沉迷電玩，影響了睡眠。"},{"en":"The clinic helps people overcome drug addiction.","zh":"這間診所協助人們戒除藥物成癮。"}],"hook":"addict（使沉迷）+ -ion（名詞字尾）","confuse":["addition","addict"]},"administer":{"ex":[{"en":"She administers a small language school.","zh":"她管理一間小型語言學校。"},{"en":"The mayor administers the city with help from her staff.","zh":"市長在幕僚協助下治理這座城市。"}],"hook":"minister 原指「僕人」；管理者為人辦事","confuse":["administrate","administration"]},"administrate":{"ex":[{"en":"She was hired to administrate the regional office.","zh":"她受聘管理這間區域辦事處。"},{"en":"The team administrates several community programs.","zh":"這個團隊負責管理好幾項社區計畫。"}],"hook":"administr- 是「管理」的字根；-ate 常作動詞字尾","confuse":["administer","administration"]},"admiral":{"ex":[{"en":"The admiral led the fleet into the harbor.","zh":"海軍上將率領艦隊駛入港口。"},{"en":"An admiral spoke at the naval academy.","zh":"一位海軍上將在海軍官校演講。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["admirable"]},"adolescence":{"ex":[{"en":"Many people experience rapid growth during adolescence.","zh":"許多人在青春期會快速成長。"},{"en":"She moved abroad during adolescence.","zh":"她在青春期時搬到國外。"}],"hook":"adolesc- 源自表示「成長」的拉丁字根","confuse":["adolescent","adulthood"]},"advisory":{"ex":[{"en":"The school issued an advisory notice about the storm.","zh":"學校發布了有關這場暴風雨的提醒公告。"},{"en":"Our advisory team meets every Friday.","zh":"我們的顧問團隊每週五開會。"}],"hook":"advise（建議）+ -ory（形容詞字尾）","confuse":["advice","advise"]},"aesthetic":{"ex":[{"en":"The artist focused on aesthetic details.","zh":"這位藝術家著重於美學細節。"},{"en":"The building's aesthetic appeal attracts visitors.","zh":"這棟建築的美感吸引了許多遊客。"}],"hook":"aesthet- 源自希臘文「感知」","confuse":["anesthetic","artistic"]},"affectionate":{"ex":[{"en":"My dog is affectionate with every visitor.","zh":"我的狗對每位來訪者都很親熱。"},{"en":"She wrote an affectionate note to her grandmother.","zh":"她寫了一張充滿愛意的小卡片給奶奶。"}],"hook":"affection（感情）+ -ate（形容詞字尾）","confuse":["effective","affection"]},"affiliate":{"ex":[{"en":"The hospital is an affiliate of the university.","zh":"這間醫院是該大學的附屬機構。"},{"en":"The company opened an affiliate in Kaohsiung.","zh":"這家公司在高雄成立了一間分公司。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["affiliation","subsidiary"]},"affirm":{"ex":[{"en":"She affirmed that the report was accurate.","zh":"她肯定這份報告內容正確。"},{"en":"The witness affirmed his earlier statement.","zh":"證人再次肯定自己先前的說法。"}],"hook":"firm 有「堅定」之意；affirm 是堅定表明","confuse":["confirm","assert"]},"airtight":{"ex":[{"en":"Store the cookies in an airtight container.","zh":"把餅乾收在密封容器裡。"},{"en":"The lid keeps the jar airtight.","zh":"這個蓋子能讓罐子保持密封。"}],"hook":"air + tight：想像空氣被緊緊封住","confuse":["watertight","airless"]},"airway":{"ex":[{"en":"Smoke can irritate your airway.","zh":"煙霧可能會刺激你的呼吸道。"},{"en":"The doctor checked his airway after the accident.","zh":"事故發生後，醫生檢查了他的呼吸道。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["railway","windpipe"]},"algebra":{"ex":[{"en":"We used algebra to solve for x.","zh":"我們用代數解出 x。"},{"en":"Algebra can describe patterns with symbols.","zh":"代數可以用符號表示各種規律。"}],"hook":"al-jabr 是阿拉伯文，意為「復原、整理」","confuse":["geometry","algorithm"]},"alienate":{"ex":[{"en":"His rude comments alienated his classmates.","zh":"他無禮的評論使同學疏遠了他。"},{"en":"The policy may alienate longtime supporters.","zh":"這項政策可能會使長期支持者感到疏離。"}],"hook":"alien 是「外來者、陌生人」；alienate 使人變陌生","confuse":["isolate","alien"]},"align":{"ex":[{"en":"Please align the chairs along the wall.","zh":"請把椅子沿著牆排整齊。"},{"en":"The text should align with the left margin.","zh":"文字應與左邊界對齊。"}],"hook":"line（線）藏在 align 裡：排到同一直線","confuse":["alliance","assign"]},"allege":{"ex":[{"en":"The suspect alleged that he was at home all night.","zh":"嫌疑犯聲稱他整晚都在家裡。"},{"en":"She alleged that the company had hidden the safety problems.","zh":"她指稱公司隱瞞了安全問題。"}],"hook":"al- 向 + leg 陳述、法律（同 legal）","confuse":["allergy","alleviate"]},"alligator":{"ex":[{"en":"An alligator lay motionless on the riverbank under the sun.","zh":"一隻短吻鱷在河岸上的陽光下一動也不動。"},{"en":"Alligators can hold their breath for a long time underwater.","zh":"短吻鱷能在水下憋氣很長一段時間。"}],"hook":"源自西班牙文 el lagarto（蜥蜴）","confuse":["crocodile"]},"altitude":{"ex":[{"en":"The plane flew at an altitude of ten thousand meters.","zh":"飛機以一萬公尺的高度飛行。"},{"en":"Many climbers get sick when they reach high altitude.","zh":"許多登山者到達高海拔時會身體不適。"}],"hook":"alt- 高（拉丁文 altus）+ -itude 名詞字尾，如 alto 高音","confuse":["attitude","aptitude"]},"aluminum":{"ex":[{"en":"The soda can is made of thin aluminum.","zh":"這個汽水罐是用薄鋁片做的。"},{"en":"Aluminum is light, so airplanes often use it.","zh":"鋁很輕，所以飛機常使用它。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["aluminium"]},"ambiguity":{"ex":[{"en":"The ambiguity of the contract confused both sides.","zh":"這份合約的模稜兩可讓雙方都感到困惑。"},{"en":"Please avoid ambiguity when you write your report.","zh":"寫報告時請避免含糊不清。"}],"hook":"ambi- 兩、雙（如 ambidextrous 雙手都靈巧）","confuse":["ambiguous","ambition"]},"amid":{"ex":[{"en":"She smiled amid the noise of the crowded market.","zh":"她在擁擠市場的喧鬧聲中微笑。"},{"en":"Amid the rain, the children kept playing in the park.","zh":"儘管下著雨，孩子們仍在公園裡玩耍。"}],"hook":"a- 在 + mid 中間","confuse":["amidst","among"]},"amidst":{"ex":[{"en":"Amidst the chaos, the teacher stayed calm and focused.","zh":"在一片混亂之中，老師依然冷靜專注。"},{"en":"The village stood quietly amidst the green hills.","zh":"這個村莊靜靜地坐落在青翠的山丘之中。"}],"hook":"amid 加 -st，意思相同，語氣較文雅","confuse":["amid","among"]},"amplify":{"ex":[{"en":"The microphone helps amplify the singer's voice.","zh":"麥克風能幫助放大歌手的聲音。"},{"en":"Social media can amplify small rumors into big news.","zh":"社群媒體會把小道消息放大成大新聞。"}],"hook":"ampl- 大（如 ample 充足）+ -ify 使…","confuse":["ample","simplify"]},"analogy":{"ex":[{"en":"The teacher used an analogy to explain how the heart works.","zh":"老師用一個比喻來解釋心臟如何運作。"},{"en":"The writer drew an analogy between learning and climbing.","zh":"作者把學習比作攀登，做了一個類比。"}],"hook":"ana- 按照 + logy 比例、道理（同 logic）","confuse":["analog","anatomy"]},"analytical":{"ex":[{"en":"She has an analytical mind and loves solving problems.","zh":"她有善於分析的頭腦，喜歡解決問題。"},{"en":"His analytical report explained the causes step by step.","zh":"他的分析報告一步一步解釋了原因。"}],"hook":"analy- 分解（希臘文 analyein 拆開）+ -tical 形容詞字尾","confuse":["analysis","analogy"]},"anchor":{"ex":[{"en":"The ship dropped its anchor near the harbor.","zh":"船在港口附近放下了錨。"},{"en":"The news anchor read the headlines calmly.","zh":"新聞主播冷靜地播報頭條。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["anchovy","anchorage"]},"animate":{"ex":[{"en":"The clown's jokes animated the quiet children.","zh":"小丑的笑話讓安靜的孩子們活潑起來。"},{"en":"Good teachers know how to animate their classes.","zh":"好老師知道如何讓課堂充滿活力。"}],"hook":"anim 生命、靈魂，同 animal 動物、animation 動畫","confuse":["animal","animation"]},"annoyance":{"ex":[{"en":"To my annoyance, the phone rang again during the movie.","zh":"令我懊惱的是，電影播放時手機又響了。"},{"en":"The constant noise from the street was an annoyance.","zh":"街上持續的噪音令人非常煩躁。"}],"hook":"annoy 惹惱 + -ance 名詞字尾","confuse":["annoy","annoying"]},"anthem":{"ex":[{"en":"The whole stadium stood up to sing the national anthem.","zh":"全場體育館的人都起立唱國歌。"},{"en":"The team's victory song became their unofficial anthem.","zh":"球隊的勝利之歌成了他們的非正式隊歌。"}],"hook":"","confuse":[]},"antibiotic":{"ex":[{"en":"The doctor prescribed an antibiotic for her infection.","zh":"醫生為她的感染開了抗生素。"},{"en":"Do not take antibiotics for a common cold.","zh":"不要因為普通感冒就吃抗生素。"}],"hook":"anti- 反對 + bio 生命 + -tic，即對抗微生物","confuse":["antibody","antiseptic"]},"anticipation":{"ex":[{"en":"The children waited with anticipation for the holiday.","zh":"孩子們滿懷期待地等待假期到來。"},{"en":"Her anticipation of the trip kept her awake all night.","zh":"她對這趟旅行的期待讓她整晚睡不著。"}],"hook":"ante- 預先 + capere 拿取，anticipate 預先拿到","confuse":["anticipate","participation"]},"antonym":{"ex":[{"en":"The antonym of hot is cold.","zh":"hot 的反義詞是 cold。"},{"en":"Please find an antonym for the word happy.","zh":"請為 happy 這個字找一個反義詞。"}],"hook":"anti- 反 + -onym 名字（同 synonym 同義詞）","confuse":["synonym","acronym"]},"applaud":{"ex":[{"en":"The audience applauded loudly after the wonderful performance.","zh":"精彩的表演結束後，觀眾大聲鼓掌。"},{"en":"We applauded the students for their hard work.","zh":"我們為學生的努力拍手喝采。"}],"hook":"ap- 向 + plaud 拍手（同 explode 爆發，字根不同但拼音相近）","confuse":["applause","applied"]},"applicable":{"ex":[{"en":"This rule is applicable to all students in the school.","zh":"這項規定適用於校內所有學生。"},{"en":"Please check whether the discount is applicable to your order.","zh":"請確認這項折扣是否適用於您的訂單。"}],"hook":"apply 應用 + -able 能…的","confuse":["applicant","appliance"]},"apprentice":{"ex":[{"en":"He worked as an apprentice to a skilled carpenter.","zh":"他在一位技術純熟的木匠底下當學徒。"},{"en":"The young apprentice learned to fix engines from his master.","zh":"年輕學徒向師傅學習修理引擎。"}],"hook":"與 learn 同源：法文 apprendre 學習","confuse":["apprehend","appreciate"]},"approximate":{"ex":[{"en":"The approximate cost of the trip is five thousand dollars.","zh":"這趟旅行的大約費用是五千元。"},{"en":"Give me an approximate time when you will arrive.","zh":"請告訴我你大約幾點會到。"}],"hook":"ap- 向 + proxim 近（同 proximity 鄰近）","confuse":["approve","proximity"]},"archaeology":{"ex":[{"en":"She studies archaeology and digs up ancient pottery.","zh":"她主修考古學，挖掘古代陶器。"},{"en":"Archaeology helps us understand how people lived long ago.","zh":"考古學幫助我們了解古人的生活。"}],"hook":"archae- 古老（如 archaic 古舊）+ -logy 學問","confuse":["archaic","archery"]},"archive":{"ex":[{"en":"The old letters are kept in the city archive.","zh":"這些舊信件保存在市立檔案館裡。"},{"en":"Please save the files in the archive folder.","zh":"請把這些檔案存到封存資料夾裡。"}],"hook":"源自希臘文 arkheion 官署，存放官方文件的地方","confuse":["arch","archer"]},"arithmetic":{"ex":[{"en":"Children learn basic arithmetic in elementary school.","zh":"孩子們在小學學習基本算術。"},{"en":"She checked her arithmetic twice before handing in the test.","zh":"交考卷前她把計算又檢查了兩次。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["algebra","arctic"]},"ascend":{"ex":[{"en":"The hot air balloon slowly began to ascend into the sky.","zh":"熱氣球開始慢慢升上天空。"},{"en":"The climbers will ascend the mountain at dawn.","zh":"登山者將在黎明時分登上這座山。"}],"hook":"as- 向上（同 ad- 向）+ scend 爬（同 scale 攀登）","confuse":["ascent","descend"]},"aspire":{"ex":[{"en":"She aspires to become a doctor.","zh":"她立志成為醫師。"},{"en":"Many students aspire to study abroad.","zh":"許多學生渴望出國讀書。"}],"hook":"ad- 朝向 + spirare 呼吸，聯想朝目標奮力追求","confuse":["inspire","perspire"]},"assassinate":{"ex":[{"en":"The plot was to assassinate the king.","zh":"這項陰謀是要暗殺國王。"},{"en":"The dictator was assassinated in 1980.","zh":"那名獨裁者於 1980 年遭到暗殺。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["assault","eliminate"]},"asthma":{"ex":[{"en":"He uses an inhaler when his asthma flares up.","zh":"他氣喘發作時會使用吸入器。"},{"en":"Cold air can trigger her asthma.","zh":"冷空氣可能引發她的氣喘。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["asphyxia"]},"astray":{"ex":[{"en":"The hikers went astray in the fog.","zh":"登山客在霧中迷了路。"},{"en":"His advice led me astray.","zh":"他的建議讓我走上歧途。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["array","away"]},"astronaut":{"ex":[{"en":"The astronaut floated inside the space station.","zh":"太空人在太空站裡漂浮。"},{"en":"She hopes to become an astronaut one day.","zh":"她希望有一天能成為太空人。"}],"hook":"astro-「星」+ naut-「航海者」，想成星際航行者","confuse":["astronomer","cosmonaut"]},"astronomer":{"ex":[{"en":"The astronomer studied a distant planet.","zh":"天文學家研究一顆遙遠的行星。"},{"en":"An astronomer explained the eclipse to us.","zh":"一位天文學家向我們解說日食。"}],"hook":"astro-「星」也出現在 astronaut，都是和星空有關","confuse":["astronaut","astrologer"]},"astronomy":{"ex":[{"en":"We learned about black holes in astronomy class.","zh":"我們在天文學課上學到黑洞。"},{"en":"Astronomy helps us understand the universe.","zh":"天文學幫助我們了解宇宙。"}],"hook":"astro-「星」+ -nomy「規律、學問」","confuse":["astrology","astrometry"]},"attain":{"ex":[{"en":"She worked hard to attain her goal.","zh":"她努力達成自己的目標。"},{"en":"He attained a high score on the exam.","zh":"他在考試中取得高分。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["obtain","achieve"]},"attainment":{"ex":[{"en":"The award recognized her academic attainment.","zh":"這個獎項肯定了她的學業成就。"},{"en":"The attainment of peace took many years.","zh":"達成和平花了很多年。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["achievement","attain"]},"attendant":{"ex":[{"en":"A flight attendant helped us find our seats.","zh":"一位空服員幫我們找到座位。"},{"en":"The parking attendant gave me a ticket.","zh":"停車場服務員給了我一張票。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["attendance","attendee"]},"audit":{"ex":[{"en":"The annual audit revealed several errors.","zh":"年度查帳發現了幾個錯誤。"},{"en":"The company passed its tax audit.","zh":"這家公司通過了稅務查帳。"}],"hook":"aud- 源自「聽」；查帳時逐筆核對帳目","confuse":["auditor","edit"]},"auditorium":{"ex":[{"en":"The ceremony will take place in the auditorium.","zh":"典禮將在禮堂舉行。"},{"en":"Students filled the auditorium for the concert.","zh":"學生擠滿禮堂欣賞音樂會。"}],"hook":"audire「聽」+ -orium「場所」，就是聽演講的地方","confuse":["audition","stadium"]},"avert":{"ex":[{"en":"Quick action helped avert a serious accident.","zh":"迅速採取行動幫助避免了一場重大事故。"},{"en":"She tried to avert her eyes from the screen.","zh":"她試著把目光從螢幕上移開。"}],"hook":"vert＝轉；把危險轉開","confuse":["avoid","divert"]},"aviation":{"ex":[{"en":"Aviation has changed how people travel.","zh":"航空業改變了人們的旅行方式。"},{"en":"He plans to study aviation in college.","zh":"他計畫在大學攻讀航空相關科系。"}],"hook":"avi- 源自 avis「鳥」，聯想飛行","confuse":["navigation","avocation"]},"awesome":{"ex":[{"en":"The view from the mountain was awesome.","zh":"從山上看到的景色超棒。"},{"en":"You did an awesome job on the project.","zh":"你把這個專題做得很出色。"}],"hook":"awe「敬畏」+ -some「令人……的」","confuse":["awful","amazing"]},"awhile":{"ex":[{"en":"Let’s sit here and rest awhile.","zh":"我們坐在這裡休息一會兒吧。"},{"en":"She stayed awhile after class.","zh":"她下課後多留了一會兒。"}],"hook":"","confuse":["while","a while"]}}}